9;87m✶[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[54B[38;2;215;119;87m✻[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[54B[38;2;215;119;87m✽[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l]0;◑ Engineer optimal LLM prompt for task solving[?2026h[?25l[H[51B[38;2;153;153;153m [15C[3B9[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[54B[38;2;215;119;87m✻[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l]0;✳ Engineer optimal LLM prompt for task solving[?2026h[?25l[H[2G[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 664 [22mground-truth harness: `(query, expected_prompt_id[])` fixtures, recall@k, MRR,[1C[1B[2m 665 [22mnDCG. Hand-label ~50 queries from the existing 155. *Done when:* current `dev`[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 666 [22mretrieval has a baseline number. Everything after this is measured against it,[1C[1B[2m 667 [22mand without it nothing after this is measurable.[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 668 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 669 [22m**Phase 2 — chunking (2 days).** `prompt_chunks` table, chunker, chunk[78G[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 670 [22membedding, chunk-level retrieval + rollup. Raise `MAX_DOC_CHARS`. *Done when:*[1C[1B[2m 671 [22mrecall@10 beats the Phase-1 baseline, and the 276 truncated prompts are fully[1C[1B[2m 672 [22mindexed.[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 673 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 674 [22m**Phase 3 — retrieval rework (1 day).** Three channels, `simple` config exact[1C[1B[2m 675 [22mtsv, AND semantics, 0.85/0.15 weights in config. *Done when:* a query[1C[1B[2m 676 [22mcontaining `snake_case_identifier` retrieves the prompt containing it — the[1C[1B[2m 677 [22mcase that fails today — with no regression on the Phase-1 prose queries.[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 678 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 679 [22m**Phase 4 — slots and base info (2–3 days).** `prompt_slots`, `base_info`,[1C[1B[2m 680 [22mingest-time extraction, the fill algorithm, validation, `cap slots review`.[1C[1B[2m 681 [22m*Done when:* the QBR worked example in §3 runs end to end and produces exactly[1C[1B[2m 682 [22mtwo needs.[1C[1B[2m 683 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 684 [22m**Phase 5 — DSPy modules (2 days).** `ExtractSlots` compiled with[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 685 [22m`BootstrapFewShot` on the reviewed slots. `WriteQuery` compiled against the[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 686 [22mPhase-1 eval set. Rewrite `metrics.py` — programmatic first, pairwise judge[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 687 [22mlast. Delete `harvest.py`. *Done when:* a compiled `ExtractSlots` beats the[1C[1B[2m 688 [22muncompiled baseline on held-out folds and the delta survives cross-validation.[1C[1B[2m 689 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 690 [22m**Phase 6 — dedup + hygiene.** Near-duplicate report, embedding-version guard.[1C[1B[2m 691 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 692 [22mPhases 0–1 before 2–4 is the ordering that matters. Building chunking first[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 693 [22mwould feel faster and leave you unable to tell whether it worked.[1C[1B[2m 694 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 695 [22m---[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 696 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 697 [22m## 8. Open questions[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 698 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 699 [22mEach has a default, so none of this blocks.[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 700 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 701 [22m1. **Does `base_info` sync from `arteries.evergreen`, or is it independently[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 702 [22m   maintained?** *Default:* one-way sync from arteries, with manual rows[1C[1B[2m 703 [22m   allowed at `scope='global'`. Avoids a second place to type your company[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 704 [22m   name.[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 705 [22m2. **Slot review — CLI or generated Markdown for editing in Obsidian?**[1C[1B[2m 706 [22m   *Default:* CLI. It writes straight to Postgres; a Markdown round-trip needs[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 707 [22m   a parser you'd then have to maintain.[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 708 [22m3. **Does `chunk_text` get its heading breadcrumb stored, or prepended only at[1C[1B[2m 709 [22m   embed time?** *Default:* prepend at embed time, store clean. Keeps[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 710 [22m   `chunk_text` byte-identical to a `prompt_text` slice, which makes offset[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 711 [22m   validation trivial.[1C[1B[2m 712 [22m4. **Is the 41 881-char prompt one prompt or several?** *Default:* chunk it[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 713 [22m   mechanically and flag it. It probably wants splitting in the vault, but[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 714 [22m   that's your editorial call.[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 715 [22m5. **Do you want per-prompt DSPy optimization kept for the top-20 by traffic,[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 716 [22m   or dropped entirely for now?** *Default:* keep the code path, don't run it[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 717 [22m   until §5's tier 4 is reached.[1B[38;2;80;80;80m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌[1B[39m Do you want to create [1mrework_design.md[22m?[K[1C[1B[38;2;177;185;249m❯[4G[38;2;153;153;153m1. [38;2;177;185;249mYes[1B[39m   [38;2;153;153;153m2. [39mYes, allow all edits during this session [1m(shift+tab)[22m[K[1B  [4G[38;2;153;153;153m3. [39mNo[1B[K[1C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mEsc to cancel · Tab[22Gto amend[39m[K[61;1H[57;2H[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h]0;◑ Engineer optimal LLM prompt for task solving[?2026h[H[2G - [1m**Closing the loop.**[22m The diagram sends Results → DSPy → Optimized prompts. Specify[1C[1B   the execution-trace schema logged at run time so that today's executions become[K[1C[1B   tomorrow's training set. This is the single highest-leverage thing to build early[87G—[1C[1B   say so if you agree.[K[1C[1B - [1m**Optimizing retrieval too**[22m,[35Gnot[39Gjust[44Ggeneration:[56Gthe[60Gfill[65Gstep[70Gand[74Gthe[78Gquery[1C[1B   formulation are both DSPy modules.[K[1C[1B - [1m**Skills:**[22m state exactly how a skill's instruction body is optimized and what[K[1C[1B   parts of it must stay frozen.[K[1C[1B - [1m**Guardrails:**[21G[22mtrain/dev[31Gseparation[42Gwith[47Gtiny[52Gdata,[58Goverfitting[70Grisk,[76Gversioning[1C[1B   optimized[15Gartifacts,[26Gand[30Ghow[34Ga[36Gregression[47Ggets[52Gcaught[59Gand[63Grolled[70Gback.[1C[1B[K[1C[1B ## Step 6: Gaps the user didn't ask about[K[1C[1B List components missing from the diagram that this system will need. For each: what[1C[1B it is, why it's needed, and whether it's needed [1m**now**[22m or [1m**later**[22m. Be selective[86G—[1C[1B five[8Greal[13Ggaps[18Gbeat[23Gfifteen[31Gspeculative[43Gones.[49GConsider[58Gat[61Gminimum:[70Gevaluation[1C[1B harness, versioning/provenance of prompts, embedding-model change and re-index[1C[1B strategy, deduplication, observability, and cost/latency budget.[K[1C[1B[K[1C[1B # CONSTRAINTS[K[1C[1B - [1m**Stdlib-first.**[23G[22mOnly[28Gintroduce[38Ga[40Gdependency[51Gwhen[56Gthe[60Gstandard[69Glibrary[77Gor[80Gan[1C[1B   already-installed package genuinely falls short; when you do, say what[76Git[79Gbuys.[1C[1B - No speculative abstraction: no interface with one implementation, no config for[85Ga[1C[1B   value that never changes.[K[1C