3 600 rows, and — more important — sections stop[65Gstanding[74Galone.[81GYour[86Gcorpus[93Gis[96Galready[104Gfragmenting[116Ginto[121Ggeneric[129G[38;2;177;185;249minstructions[142G[39m(527)[148Gand[152G[38;2;177;185;249mguardrails[163G[39m(112)[169Gblocks;[177Gcutting[185Gfiner[191Gproduces[200Gmore[205Gchunks[212Gwhose[218Gtext[223Gcould[229Gbelong[236Gto[239Gany[243Gof[246G900[2C[1Bprompts.[12GAlso drops single-chunk[36Gprompts from[49G475[53Gto[56G~250, meaning[70Gmore[75Gshort[81Gprompts[89Gget[93Gsplit[99Gthat[104Gshouldn't[114Gbe.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mMy recommendation for the rework: TARGET 1 200, CEILING 4 000, and raise [38;2;177;185;249mMAX_DOC_CHARS[39m to 2 000.[100G[22mThat[105Gputs[110Gp90[114Gat[117G1[119G864[123G—[125G~94%[130Gof[133Gchunks[140Gfully[146Gvisible[154Gto[157Gthe[161Greranker[170Ginstead[178Gof[181G79%[185G—[187Gat[190Ga[192Gcost[197Gof[200G+356[205Grows,[211Gwhich[217Gis[220Gnothing[228Gat[231Gthis[236Gscale.[243GIt[246Gsits[251Gin[2C[1Bthe flat region of the dilution curve, so you give up no embedding[70Gquality[78Gfor[82Git.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThe two knobs are coupled and should be set together. The alternative[73G—[75Gkeep[80G1[82G600[86Gand[90Graise[96G[38;2;177;185;249mMAX_DOC_CHARS[110G[39mto[113G2[115G400[119G—[121Galso[126Gworks,[133Gbut[137G512[141Gtokens[148Gis[151Ga[153Ghard[158Gmodel[164Glimit,[171Gnot[175Ga[177Gconfig[184Gvalue,[191Gso[194Gyou[198Gcan't[204Gpush[209Gthe[213Greranker[222Gmuch[227Gpast[232G~2[235G000[239Gchars.[246GBetter[253Gto[2C[1Bmove the[12Gknob you actually[30Gcontrol.[43G[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1m3. What Obsidian ingest should take in[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BThe[7Gprinciple[17Gfor[21Gthe[25Grework:[33G[1mingest owns raw truth and nothing derived.[76G[22mRight[82Gnow[86Git[89Gwrites[96G[38;2;177;185;249mprompts[104G[39m[3mand[108G[23mbuilds[115G[38;2;177;185;249msearch_tsv[126G[39m—[128Gone[132Gderived[140Gartifact[149G—[151Gwhile[157Gchunking[166Gbuilds[173Gothers.[181GThat[186Gsplit[192Gis[195Gexactly[203Ghow[207Gthe[211Gdesync[218GI[220Gfound[226Ghappens.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BIngest[10Gwrites[17Gonly:[2C[1B-[5G[38;2;177;185;249mtitle[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mfile_path[39m,[23G[38;2;177;185;249mfile_mtime[34G[39m[K[2C[1B- [38;2;177;185;249mprompt_text[39m —[19G[1mbyte-exact, no normalization, no whitespace collapsing, no acronym expansion.[97G[22mNon-negotiable[112Gnow:[117G[38;2;177;185;249mchar_start[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mchar_end[137G[39mare[141Gonly[146Gmeaningful[157Gif[160Gthe[164Gstored[171Gstring[178Gis[181Gthe[185Gone[189Gthat[194Gwas[198Gchunked.[2C[1B-[5G[38;2;177;185;249mcontent_hash[2C[1B[39m- frontmatter → taxonomy[28Gfields[2C[1B-[5G[38;2;177;185;249mneeds_reindex = TRUE[26G[39mwhen[31Gthe[35Ghash[40Gchanged[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThen[8Ga[10Gseparate[19G[38;2;177;185;249mreindex[27G[39mpass[32Gconsumes[41G[38;2;177;185;249mneeds_reindex[55G[39mand[59Grebuilds[68Gchunks,[76Gembeddings,[88Gboth[93Gtsvectors,[104Gand[108Gslots[114Gfor[118Gjust[123Gthose[129Gprompts.[138GIngest[145Gstays[151Gdumb;[157Gone[161Gpass[166Gowns[171Gevery[177Gderived[185Gartifact.[195GThat's[202Gthe[206Gstructural[217Gfix[221Gfor[225Gthe[229Gdesync,[237Gand[241Git[244Gmakes[2C[1Bre-chunking after a TARGET change a normal operation rather than a full rebuild.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BTwo things worth adding to the frontmatter contract, since your vault has no consistent structure[101Gand[105Gthe[109Gchunker[117Gcan[121Gonly[126Gguess:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B- [38;2;177;185;249m[1mchunk: manual[39m / explicit section markers[22m for the handful of monoliths. [38;2;177;185;249mSaaS Financial Model Investor-Ready[112G[39mproduces[121Gfour[126Gatomic[133Gchunks[140Gof[143G7–8k[148