[119G—[121Galso[126Gworks,[133Gbut[137G512[141Gtokens[148Gis[151Ga[153Ghard[158Gmodel[164Glimit,[171Gnot[175Ga[177Gconfig[184Gvalue,[191Gso[194Gyou[198Gcan't[204Gpush[209Gthe[213Greranker[222Gmuch[227Gpast[232G~2[235G000[239Gchars.[246GBetter[253Gto[2C[1Bmove the knob[17Gy[19Gu[21Gactually control.[K[2C[2B[1m3. What Obsidian ingest should take in[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BThe principle[17Gfor the rework: [1mi[35Ggest owns raw[49Gtrut[54G and nothing der[71Gved.[22m Right now it writes [38;2;177;185;249mprompts[39m [3mand[23m [109Guilds [38;2;177;185;249msearch[122Gtsv[39m — one derived artifact — while[157Gchunking build[172G others.[181GT[183Gat split is exa[199Gtly how[207Gthe[211Gdesync[218GI[220Gfound[226Ghappens.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BIngest wri[15Gs[17Gonly:[K[4C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mtitle[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mf[14Gle_path[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mfile_mtime[39m[K[2C[1B-[5G[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_text[17G[39m—[19G[1mbyte-exact, no normalization, no whitespace collapsing, no acronym expansion.[97G[22mNon-negotiable[112Gnow:[117G[38;2;177;185;249mchar_start[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mchar_end[137G[39mare[141Gonly[146Gmeaningful[157Gif[160Gthe[164Gstored[171Gstring[178Gis[181Gthe[185Gone[189Gthat[194Gwas[198Gchunked.[2C[1B- [38;2;177;185;249mcontent_hash[39m[K[2C[1B- frontmatter → taxonomy fields[K[2C[1B-[5G[38;2;177;185;249mneeds_reindex = TRUE[26G[39mwhen[31Gthe[35Ghash[40Gchanged[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThen[8Ga[10Gseparate[19G[38;2;177;185;249mreindex[27G[39mpass[32Gconsumes[41G[38;2;177;185;249mneeds_reindex[55G[39mand[59Grebuilds[68Gchunks,[76Gembeddings,[88Gboth[93Gtsvectors,[104Gand[108Gslots[114Gfor[118Gjust[123Gthose[129Gprompts.[138GIngest[145Gstays[151Gdumb;[157Gone[161Gpass[166Gowns[171Gevery[177Gderived[185Gartifact.[195GThat's[202Gthe[206Gstructural[217Gfix[221Gfor[225Gthe[229Gdesync,[237Gand[241Git[244Gmakes[2C[1Bre-chunking after a TARGET change a normal[46Goperation rather than a full rebuild.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BTwo [8Ghi[11Ggs worth addin[26G to[30Gthe frontmatter[46Gcontract,[56Gsince[62Gyour[67Gvault[73Ghas[77Gno[80Gconsistent[91Gstructure[101Gand[105Gthe[109Gchunker[117Gcan[121Gonly[126Gguess:[2C[2B- [38;2;177;185;249m[1mchunk: manual[39m / explicit section markers[22m for the handful of monoliths. [38;2;177;185;249mSaaS Financial Model Investor-Ready[39m prod[117Gce[120G four atomic chunks[140Gof[143G7–8k because[156Gits "Step N" blocks are indiv[186Gsibl[191G tables. A[202Ghuman hint be[217Gs a[221Gbetter heuristic here.[K[2C[1B- [1mA vault-hygiene report, not a fix.[40G[22mIngest[47Gshould[54G[3mcount[60G[23mthe[64G169[68Gself-duplicated[84Gprompts[92Gand[96Gtell[101Gyou,[106Grather[113Gthan[118Gsilently[127Gdeduping[136Gdownstream[147Gforever.[156GThat[161Gduplication[173Gis[176Ga[178Gvault[184Gproblem;[193Gfixing[200Git[203Gat[206Gsource[213Gdeletes[221G~8%[225Gof[228Gyour[233Gcorpus[240Gthat[245Gshouldn't[2C[1Bexist[9Gand[13Gmakes[19Gcoverage[28Ga[30Greal[35G100%.[1B[K[2C[1BOne[7Gopen[12Gquestion[21Gthat[26Gchanges[34Gthe[38Gingest[45Gdesign:[53Gare[57Gthose[63G169[67Gduplicates[78Gdeliberate[89G—[91Ga[93G"v1[97G/[99Gv2"[103Gconvention[114Gyou[118Guse[122Gin[125Gthe[129Gnotes[135G—[137Gor[140Gan[143Gaccident?[153GIf[156Gdeliberate,[168Gingest[175Gshould[182Gsplit[188Gthem[193Ginto[198Gtwo[202Gprompt[209Grows[214Grather[221Gthan[226Gcollapse[235Gthem,[241Gand[245Gmy[248Gdedup[1B [3Gis destroying information.[K[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GSautéed for 2m 32s[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m※[3G[1mrecap: [22m[3mWe're planning a rework of Capillaries' prompt indexing, chunking, and placeholder filling before writing any branch code. Next: tell me whether the 169 self-duplicated pro