───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ [1mmxbai-rerank-large-v2[22m (1.5B) │ Already on disk. 3× slower (1.56 s/50 pairs), 3.8 GB VRAM. Usually a few points of nDCG. Zero integration work — change one string │[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ [1mQwen3-Reranker-0.6B / 4B[22m     │ 2025, near top of MTEB-R/BEIR. Its distinguishing feature matters for you: it takes a [1mtask instruction[22m                             │[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ [1mbge-reranker-v2-m3[22m           │ Well-established, smaller, faster. Probably a sideways move from base-v2                                                           │[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ Cohere Rerank 3.5            │ Strong, but it's an API — sends every candidate prompt off-box. Against the grain of your local stack                              │[2C[1B└──────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThe[7Ginstruction-aware[25Gpoint[31Gis[34Gthe[38Gone[42GI'd[46Gactually[55Gchase.[62GEvery[68Gmodel[74Gin[77Gthat[82Gtable[88Gis[91Gtrained[99Gon[102GMS[105GMARCO-style[117Grelevance:[128G[3mdoes this passage answer this question[23m.[168GYour[173Gtask[178Gis[181Gdifferent[191G—[193G[3mwhich prompt template would help someone in this situation[23m.[253GA[2C[1Bguardrails bl[17Gck that's genu[32Gnely useful scores [52Gow[55