 50 queries cold[34Gis[37Gthe[41Greason[48Gthis[53Gkeeps[59Ggetting[67Gdeferred.[77GUse[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mQwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B[27G[39m(downloading[40Gnow,[45G~8[48GGB)[52Goffline[60Gover[65Gthe[69Gtop-30[76Gdense[3C[1Bc[8Gid[11Gt[13Gs per query to pr[31Gduce silve[42G labels, then revi[61Gw a[65Gd[67Gcorrect them.[3C[1BLatency is irrelevant in a batch job, [43Ghich[48Gis the one place[65Ga 4B reranker[K[3C[1Be[6Grns i[12Gs cost. Budge[26G:[28Gan aft[35Grnoon, not a week.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B---[K[3C[1B[1mDesign: evaluate offline, migrate only the winner[3C[1B[22m[K[4C[1B[1mo not add candidate vectors to Postgres.[22m Different[56Gmodels[63Ghave[68Gdifferent[3C[1Bdimensionality,[20Gand[24Gpgvector[33Gneeds[39Ga[41Gdeclared[50Gdim[54Gper[58Gcolumn[65G—[67Gso[70Ga[3C[1BPostgres-based bake-off means schema churn and an HNSW build p[67Gr candida[77Ge,[3C[1Bfor [9Gumbers [17Ghat are throwaway.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B2 072 chunks × 1[21G024[25Gdims is ~8[36GMB[39Gas[42Ga[44Gfloat32[52Gnumpy[58Garray.[65GBrute-force[77Gcosine[3C[1Bover[9Gthat[14Gis[17Gsub-millisecond.[34G[1mExact search, no index, no schema change, and[3C[1Bit's more accurate than HNSW[33G[22msince[39Gthere's no approxim[59Gtion to confound the[K[3C[1Bcomparison.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mStep 3 — [38;2;177;185;249meval/embed_bakeoff.py[39m (new, standalone)[3C[2B[22mPer candidate model:[K[3C[1B1.[7GLoad[12Gvia[16G[38;2;177;185;249msentence-transformers[39m,[39Gembed[45Gall[49G2[51G072[55Gchunks[62Gfrom[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunks.chunk_text[29G[39m(with[35Gthe[39Gsame[44G[38;2;177;185;249m{title} > {label}[62G[39mbreadcrumb[3C[1Bthat [38;2;177;185;249mchunk.embed_text()[39m in [38;2;177;185;249ms[33Gc/capillaries/chunk.py[39m b[58Gilds — reuse[71Gthat[3C[1Bfunction, don't reimplement it).[K[3C[1B2. Embed the eval queries