w,[45G~8[48GGB)[52Goffline[60Gover[65Gthe[69Gtop-30[76Gdense[3C[1Bc[8Gid[11Gt[13Gs per query to pr[31Gduce silve[42G labels, then revi[61Gw a[65Gd[67Gcorrect them.[3C[1BLatency is irrelevant in a batch job, [43Ghich[48Gis the one place[65Ga 4B reranker[K[3C[1Be[6Grns i[12Gs cost. Budge[26G:[28Gan aft[35Grnoon, not a week.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B---[K[3C[1B[1mDesign: evaluate offline, migrate only the winner[3C[1B[22m[K[4C[1B[1mo not add candidate vectors to Postgres.[22m Different[56Gmodels[63Ghave[68Gdifferent[3C[1Bdimensionality,[20Gand[24Gpgvector[33Gneeds[39Ga[41Gdeclared[50Gdim[54Gper[58Gcolumn[65G—[67Gso[70Ga[3C[1BPostgres-based bake-off means schema churn and an HNSW build p[67Gr candida[77Ge,[3C[1Bfor [9Gumbers [17Ghat are throwaway.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B2 072 chunks × 1[21G024[25Gdims is ~8[36GMB[39Gas[42Ga[44Gfloat32[52Gnumpy[58Garray.[65GBrute-force[77Gcosine[3C[1Bover[9Gthat[14Gis[17Gsub-millisecond.[34G[1mExact search, no index, no schema change, and[3C[1Bit's more accurate than HNSW[33G[22msince[39Gthere's no approxim[59Gtion to confound the[K[3C[1Bcomparison.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mStep 3 — [38;2;177;185;249meval/embed_bakeoff.py[39m (new, standalone)[3C[2B[22mPer candidate model:[K[3C[1B1.[7GLoad[12Gvia[16G[38;2;177;185;249msentence-transformers[39m,[39Gembed[45Gall[49G2[51G072[55Gchunks[62Gfrom[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunks.chunk_text[29G[39m(with[35Gthe[39Gsame[44G[38;2;177;185;249m{title} > {label}[62G[39mbreadcrumb[3C[1Bthat [38;2;177;185;249mchunk.embed_text()[39m in [38;2;177;185;249ms[33Gc/capillaries/chunk.py[39m b[58Gilds — reuse[71Gthat[3C[1Bfunction, don't reimplement it).[K[3C[1B2. Embed the eval queries using [1mthat model's own prefix convention[71G[22m(below).[3C[1B3. Brute-force cos[23Gne, roll[32Gchunks[39Gup[42Gto[45Gparents[53Gwith[58Gthe[62Grule[67Galready[75Gin[78Gthe[3C[1Bdesign [12Goc ([38;2;177;185;249mmax(chunk_score)[39m, small bonus per additional matching chunk).[K[3C[1B4[7GReport re[17Gall@1/5/10, MRR@10, and false-[49Gtrieval rat[62Gon negatives.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1BCach[9G each mode[20G's chunk[29Gmatrix to [38;2;177;185;249m.npy[39m [45Go [49G-scoring [59Gfter a[66G eval-set[76Gedit[3C[1Bdoesn't[12Gre-embed.[61;1H[56;4H[?2026l[?2026h[H[3C[3B                                 [3C[1B-[6GSeed[11Gfrom[16Gthe[20G155[24Gdistinct[33G[38;2;177;185;249mserving_log[45G[39mqueries,[54Gplus[59G15–20[65Gwritten[73Gby[76Ghand[3C[1Bto cover query classes [28Ghe hardcoded list miss[52G:[54Gidentifier/spec queries[K[3C[1B([38;2;177;185;249mtextkit/__init__.py[39m),[27Gvague-but-r[39Gal request[50G, and near-miss queries that[3C[1B[3mshould[23m return nothing.[27G[K[3C[1B- Format: [38;2;177;185;249m{"query": str, "relevant_prompt_ids": [uuid], "notes": str}[39m.[3C[1BMultiple relevant IDs allowed — the corpus has genuine near-duplicates.[3C[1B- Labe[11G at the [1mprompt[26G[22mlevel, not chunk level. Chu[54Gk ide[60Gtity changes[K[3C[1Bwhenever TARGET changes; prompt identity is stable.[56GChu[60Gk-level recall[75Gis[3C[1Bcomput[11Gd[13Gby rollup.[K[3C[1B- Inclu[12Ge ~10 negative[27Gqueries[35Gwith[40G[38;2;177;185;249mrelevant_prompt_ids: [][64G[39mto[67Gmeasure[75Gfalse[3C[1Bretrieval, which is what [38;2;177;185;249mgate.py[39m exists to prevent.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mStep 2 — labeling accelerator[3C[1B[22m[K[3C[1BHand-labeling[18G50[21Gqueries[29Gcold[34Gis[37Gthe[41Greason[48Gthis[53Gkeeps[59Ggetting[67Gdeferred.[77GUse[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mQwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B[39m (downloading now, ~8[48GGB) offline over the top-30 dense[3C[1Bcandidates per query to produce silver labels, then review and correct th[78Gm.[K[3C[1BL[6Gtency i[15Gir[18Gelevant in a batch job, which is[54G on[58G place a[67G4B [72Granker[K[3C[1Be[6Grns its cost. Budget: an[31Gaf[34Gerno[39Gn[42Gnot a[48Gweek.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B---[3C[1B[1mDesign: evaluate offline, migrate only the winner[3C[1B[22m[K[3C[1B[1mDo not add candidate vectors to Postgres.[46G[22mDifferent[56Gmodels[63Ghave[68Gdifferent[3C[1Bdimensionality, and pgvector needs a declared dim per co[61Gumn — so a[K[3C[1BPostgres-based b[21Gke-off means schem[41Gchurn and an[54GHNSW build[65Gper c[71Gndidate,[3C[1Bf[6Gr numbers that are throw[31Gway.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B2[6G072[10Gchunks[17G×[19G1[21G024[25Gdims[30Gis[33G~8[36GMB[39Gas[42Ga[44Gfloat32[52Gnumpy[58Garray.[65GBrute-force[77Gcosine[3C[1Bover that i[17Gsub-millisecond. [1mExact search, no index, no schema change, and[22m[K[3C[1B[1mit's more accurate than HNSW[22m since there's no approximation to confound the[3C[1Bcomparison.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mStep 3 — [38;2;177;185;249meval/embed_bakeoff.py[39m (new, standalone)[3C[1B[22m[K[3C[1BPer[8Gcandidate[18Gmodel:[3C[1B1. Lo[10Gd vi[15G [38;2;177;185;249msentence-transformers[39m,[39Gembed[45Gall[49G2[51G072[55Gchunks[62Gfrom[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunk[17G.chu[22Gk_text[39m (with the[39Gsam[43G [38;2;177;185;249m{title} > {label}[62G[39mb[64Geadcrumb[3C[1Bthat [38;2;177;185;249mchunk.embed_tex[25G()[39m in [38;2;177;185;249msrc/capillaries/chunk.py[39m builds — reuse that[3C[1Bfunction, don't reimpleme[30Gt it).[K[3C[1B2. Embed the eval queries us[33Gng [1mthat model's own prefix convention[71G[22m(below).[3C[1B3[7GBrute-forc[18G cosin[25G, roll chunks up to parents with the rule already in the[3C[1Bdesign doc ([38;2;177;185;249mmax(chunk_score)[39m, small bonus per additional matching chunk).[78G[K[3C[1B4. Report recall@1/5/10, MRR@10, and fal[45Ge-retrieval r[59Gte on negatives.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1BCache[10Geach[15Gmodel's[23Gchunk[29Gmatrix[36Gto[39G[38;2;177;185;249m.npy[44G[39mso[47Gre-scoring[58Gafter[64Gan[67Geval-set[76Gedit[3C[1Bdoesn't re-emb[19Gd.[K[3C[1B       [12G         [61;1H[56;4H[?2026l[?2026h[H[3C[3B-[6GSeed[11Gfrom[16Gthe[20G155[24Gdistinct[33G[38;2;177;185;249mserving_log[45G[39mqueries,[54Gplus[59G15–20[65Gwritten[73Gby[76Ghand[3C[1Bto cover query classes [28Ghe hardcoded list miss[52G:[54Gidentifier/spec queries[K[3C[1B([38;2;177;185;249mtextkit/__init__.py[39m),[27Gvague-but-r[39Gal request[50G, and near-miss queries that[3C[1B[3mshould[23m return nothing.[27G[K[3C[1B- Format: [38;2;177;185;249m{"query": str, "relevant_prompt_ids": [uuid], "notes": str}[39m.[3C[1BMultiple relevant IDs allowed — the corpus has genuine near-duplicates.[3C[1B- Labe[11G at the [1mprompt[26G[22mlevel, not chunk level. Chu[54Gk ide[60Gtity changes[K[3C[1Bwhenever TARGET changes; prompt identity is stable.[56GChu[60Gk-level recall[75Gis[3C[1Bcomput[11Gd[13Gby rollup.[K[3C[1B- Inclu[12Ge ~10 negative[27Gqueries[35Gwith[40G[38;2;177;185;249mrelevant_prompt_ids: [][64G[39mto[67Gmeasure[75Gfalse[3C[1Bretrieval, which is what [38;2;177;185;249mgate.py[39m exists to prevent.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mStep 2 — labeling accelerator[3C[1B[22m[K[3C[1BHand-labeling[18G50[21Gqueries[29Gcold[34Gis[37Gthe[41Greason[48Gthis[53Gkeeps[59Ggetting[67Gdeferred.[77GUse[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mQwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B[39m (downloading now, ~8[48GGB) offline over the top-30 dense[3C[1Bcandidates per query to produce silver labels, then review and correct th[78Gm.[K[3C[1BL[6Gtency i[15Gir[18Gelevant in a batch job, which is[54G on[58G place a[67G4B [72Granker[K[3C[1Be[6Grns its cost. Budget: an[31Gaf[34Gerno[39Gn[42Gnot a[48Gweek.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B---[3C[1B[1mDesign: evaluate offline, migrate only the winner[3C[1B[2