 level,[33Gnot[37Gchunk[43Glevel.[50GChunk[56Gidentity[65Gchanges[3C[1Bwhenever TARGET changes; prompt identity is stable. Chunk-level recall[75Gis[3C[1Bcomputed[13Gby rollup.[K[5C[1BInclude ~10 negative qu[30Gries wit[39G [38;2;177;185;249mrelevant_prompt_ids: [][39m to measure[75Gfalse[3C[1Bretrieval, which is what[29G[38;2;177;185;249mgate.py[39m exists to prevent[56G[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mStep 2 — labeling accelerator[22m[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1BHand-labeling[18G50[21Gqueries[29Gcold[34Gis[37Gthe[41Greason[48Gthis[53Gkeeps[59Ggetting[67Gdeferred.[77GUse[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mQwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B[39m (downloading[40Gnow,[45G~8[48GGB)[52Goffline[60Gover[65Gthe[69Gtop-30[76Gdense[3C[1Bcandidates[15Gper[19Gquery[25Gto[28Gproduce[36Gsilver[43Glabels,[51Gthen[56Greview[63Gand[67Gcorrect[75Gthem.[3C[1BL[6Gtency is irrelevant in[29Ga batch[37Gjob, which[48Gis the one[59Gplace a[67G4B re[73Ganker[K[3C[1Bearns its cost. Budget: an afternoon, not a[48Gweek.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B---[K[3C[1B[1mDesign: evaluate offline, migrate only the winner[3C[2BDo not add candidate vectors to Postgres.[46G[22mDifferent[56Gmodels[63Ghave[68Gdifferent[3C[1Bdimensionality, and pgvector needs a declared dim[54Gper[58Gcolumn[65G—[67Gso[70Ga[3C[1BPostgres-based[19Gbake-off[28Gmeans[34Gschema[41Gchurn[47Gand[51Gan[54GHNSW[59Gbuild[65Gper[69Gcandidate,[3C[1Bfor numbers that are throwaway.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B2 072 chunk[16G ×[19G1 024 dims is ~8 MB [40Gs a flo[48Gt32 [53Gumpy array.[65GBrute-force cosine[3C[1Bover that is sub-millisecond. [1mExact search, no index, no schema change, and[3C[1Bit's more accurate than HNSW[33G[22msince[39Gthere's[47Gno[50Gapproximation[64Gto[67Gconfound[76Gthe[3C[1Bcompariso[14G.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mS[6Gep[9G3 — [38;2;177;185;249meval/embed_bakeoff.py[39m (new, standalone)[22m[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1BPer[8Gcandidate[18Gmodel:[3C[1B1. Load via [38;2;177;185;249msentence-transformers[39m, embed all 2 072[55Gchunks[62Gfrom[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunks.chunk_text[29G[39m(with[35Gthe[39Gsame[44G[38;2;177;185;249m{title} > {label}[62G[39mbreadcrumb[3C[1Bthat [38;2;177;185;249mchunk.embed_text()[28G[39min[31G[38;2;177;185;249msrc/capillaries/chunk.py[56G[39mbuilds[63G—[65Greuse[71Gthat[3C[1Bfunction, don't reimplement it).[K[3C[1B2. Embed the eval queries using [1mthat model's own prefix convention[22m (below).[3C[1B3. Brute-force cosine, roll chunks up to parents with the rule already in[78Gthe[3C[1Bdesign doc ([38;2;177;185;249mmax(chunk_score)[39m, small[40Gbonus[46Gper[50Gadditional[61Gmatching[70Gchunk).[3C[1B4[7GReport r[16Gcall@1/5/10, MRR@10, and false-retrieval rate on negatives.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1BCache each[15Gmodel's chunk matrix to [38;2;177;185;249m.npy[39m [45Go re-scoring [59Gfter an eval-set edit[3C[1Bdoesn't re-[16Gmbed.[K[3C[2B[1mStep 4 — prefix conventions must be per-model[22m[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1BThis[9Gis[12Gthe[16Gstep[21Gmost[26Glikely[33Gto[36Gproduce[44Ga[46Gwrong[52Ganswer[59Gif[62Grushed.[70GEach[75Gfamily[3C[1Bhas its own convention, and applying arctic's[50Gprefix[57Gto[60Ga[62Gmodel[68Gthat[73Gdoesn't[3C[1Bwant[9Gone[13Gwill[18Gunfairly[27Gsink[32Git:[61;1H[56;4H[?2026l[?2026h[H[5C[3BLabel at the [1mprompt[22m level, not chunk level. Chunk identity changes  [3C[1Bwhenever[13GTARGET changes; prompt[36Gid[39Gntity is stable. Chu[60Gk-level recall is[3C[1Bcomputed by rollup.[K[3C[1B- I[8Gclude ~10 negativ[26G que[31Gies w[37Gth [38;2;177;185;249mrelevant_prompt_ids: [][39m to measure[75Gfalse[3C[1Bretrieval, which is[24Gwhat[29G[38;2;177;185;249mgate.py[37G[39mexists[44Gto[47Gprevent.[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mStep 2 — labeling accelerator[22m[K[3C[2BHand-labeling 50 queries cold[34Gis[37Gthe[41Greason[48Gthis[53Gkeeps[59Ggetting[67Gdeferred.[77GUse[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mQwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B[27G[39m(downloading[40Gnow,[45G~8[48GGB)[52Goffline[60Gover[65Gthe[69Gtop-30[76Gdense[3C[1Bc[8Gid[11Gt[13Gs per query to pr[31Gduce silve[42G labels, then revi[61Gw a[65Gd[67Gcorrect them.[3C[1BLatency is irrelevant in a batch job, [43Ghich[48Gis the one place[65Ga 4B reranker[K[3C[1Be[6Grns i[12Gs cost. Budge[26G:[28Gan aft[35Grnoon, not a week.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B---[K[3C[1B[1mDesign: evaluate offline, migrate only the winner[3C[1B[22m[K[4C[1B[1mo not add candidate vectors to Postgres.[22m Different[56Gmodels[63Ghave[68Gdifferent[3C[1Bdimensionality,[20Gand[24Gpgvector[33Gneeds[39Ga[41Gdeclared[50Gdim[54Gper[58Gcolumn[65G—[67Gso[70Ga[3C[1BPostgres-based bake-off means schema churn and an HNSW build p[67Gr candida[77Ge,[3C[1Bfor [9Gumbers [17Ghat are throwaway.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B2 072 chunks × 1[21G024[25Gdims is ~8[36GMB[39Gas[42Ga[44Gfloat32[52Gnumpy[58Garray.[65GBrute-force[77Gcosine[3C[1Bover[9Gthat[14Gis[17Gsub-millisecond.[34G[1mExact search, no index, no schema change, and[3C[1Bit's more accurate than HNSW[33G[22msince[39Gthere's no approxim[59Gtion to confound the[K[3C[1Bcomparison.[K[3C[1B[K[3C[1B[1mStep 3 — [38;2;177;185;249meval/embed_bakeoff.py[39m (new, standalone)[3C[2B[22mPer candidate model:[K[3C[1B1.[7GLoad[12Gvia[16G[38;2;177;185;249msentence-transformers[39m,[39Gembed[45Gall[49G2[51G072[55Gchunks[62Gfrom[3C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunks.chunk_text[29G[39m(with[35Gthe[39Gsame[44G[38;2;177;185;249m{title} > {label}[62G[39mbreadcrumb[3C[1Bthat [38;2;177;185;249mchunk.embed_text()[39m in [38;2;177;185;249ms[33Gc/capillaries/chunk.py[39m b[58Gilds — reuse[71Gthat[3C[1Bfunction, don't reimplement it).[K[3C[1B2. Embed the eval queries using [1mth