, `[Y]`(×32), `[N]`(×17), `[Z]`(×10) — 5 distinct forms. Keying `base_info` off the raw token would bind al[1C[1B[2m     [22ml 93 `[X]`s to one value |[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  70 [22m| 4.4 | Drop the substring fallback in `_match_context` | **[measured]** `route.py:100` binds `[BUDGET]` to a context key `budget_owner_email`. Silent and wrong |[1C[1B[2m  71 [22m| 4.5 | Never fabricate a `fact` or `artifact`; leave the slot in place and emit a structured `need` | **[reasoned]** a fabricated `[COMPANY NAME]` produces a fluent, confident, wrong document that nothing downstream can detect |[1C[1B[2m  72 [22m| 4.6 | `base_info` store, ~40–60 entries to start, synced from `arteries.evergreen` | **[measured]** repeat counts suggest small coverage goes far: `[AMOUNT]`×71, `[TIMEFRAME]`×32, `[MONTHS]`×14 |[1C[1B[2m  73 [1C[1B  74 [22m## Tier 5 — DSPy[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  75 [1C[1B  76 [22m| # | Action | Backing |[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  77 [22m|---|---|---|[30G[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  78 [22m| 5.1 | **Delete `optimize/harvest.py`** | **[measured]** `harvest.py:141` captures `output_text=row["prompt_text"]` — the retrieved prompt as the golden *output*. Trains the optimizer to reproduce the library |[1C[1B[2m  79 [22m| 5.2 | **Optimize system modules, not the corpus** — `ExtractSlots`, `InferSlot`, `WriteQuery`, `RouteMode` | **[measured]** `dspy_optimize.py` needs ≥5 examples × 916 prompts = 4 580 labels, against 155 distinct queries ever observed. Unreacha[1C[1B[2m     [22mble by construction |[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  80 [22m| 5.3 | `ExtractSlots` first, with `BootstrapFewShot` | **[measured]** 344 slot instances already in the vault are free labels, and the output is checkable without a judge |[1C[1B[2m  81 [22m| 5.4 | Rewrite `metrics.py`: programmatic → behavioural → episode reward → pairwise judge | **[reasoned]** `exact_match` is difflib on prose; `llm_judge` scores 0–10 absolute, the least reliable judge form |[1C[1B[2m  82 [22m| 5.5 | Never evaluate baseline and optimized on the same set | **[measured]** `dspy_optimize.py:98,107` both run over `dspy_examples`. That measures memorization |[1C[1B[2m  83 [22m| 5.6 | Raise `MIN_IMPROVEMENT` from 0.02 to 0.05 until n > 100 | **[reasoned]** 0.02 is inside the noise on a 30-example set |[1C[1B[2m  84 [1C[1B  85 [22m## Tier 6 — model selection (blocked on 1.4)[52G[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  86 [1C[1B  87 [22m| # | Action | Backing |[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  88 [22m|---|---|---|[1C[1B[2m  89 [22m| 6.1 | Keep `mxbai-rerank-base-v2` for now | **[measured]** vs Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B: Spearman 0.673, same top-1 only 8/15, top-5 overlap 60%. mxbai scores 0–1 and clears `SINGLE_THRESHOLD=0.3` on 12/15 queries; Qwen emits raw logits (−14.7 … −1.[1C[1B[2m     [22m75) and clears it on **0/15**, even after sigmoid (max 0.148) |[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  90 [22m| 6.2 | Before any reranker swap, decouple three constants from the score scale: `find.py:39` (0.30), `reranker.py:86` (0.02), `memory_filter.py` boosts (0.02–0.10) | **[measured]** all three are calibrated to mxbai's 0–1 output and silently sto[1C[1B[2m     [22mp working on a different scale |[1C[1B[2m  91 [22m| 6.3 | Embedding bake-off: arctic-embed-m-v2.0 vs Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B, offline with numpy, no schema change | **[measured]** 2 072 × 1 024 floats ≈ 8 MB; brute-force cosine is exact and sub-millisecond. Full corpus re-embed is **~23 s** — swap[1C[1B[2m     [22mping is cheap to try and cheap to revert |[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  92 [22m| 6.4 | Recalibrate `gate.py:49` `SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD` (0.47) after any embedding change | **[measured]** hand-fitted to arctic's cosine distribution in a 0.036-wide gap. Cosine scales are not comparable across models |[1C[1B[2m  93 [22m| 6.5 | Test Qwen3-Embedding's per-call-site instructions | **[unverified]** three sites (`gate.py:219`, `retriever.py:169`, `skills/recall.py:251`) share one prefix but ask three different questions. Mechanism is plausible; evidence is zero |[1C[1B[2m  94 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  95 [22m---[11G[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m  96 [1B[22m[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m  97 [22m## Corrections made during the audit[1C[1B[2m  98 [1B[22m[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m  99 [22mRecorded because each one changed a recommendation, and the reasoning that[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 100 [22mproduced them will otherwise repeat.[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 101 [22m[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 102 [22m1. **"The reranker has a 512-token window."** Wrong. Taken from the stale[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 103 [22m   docstring at `reranker.py:8-10`. The loaded model is Qwen2.5-0.5B-based with[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 104 [22m   `max_position_embeddings: 32768`. This had propagated into a recommendation[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 105 [22m   to drop TARGET to 1 200 — withdrawn; 1 600 stands.[61G[39m[K[1C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 106 [22m2. **"Headings are the section delimiter."** Wrong. Only 109 of 916 prompts[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 107 [22m   have Markdown headings; 510 have no structural marker at all. The chunker is[1C[1B[2m 108 [22m   a cascade (XML → heading → rule → bold → paragraph) as a result.[1C[1B[2m 109 [22m3. **"Long prompts will flood results with fragments."** Wrong, and backwards.[1C[1B[2m 110 [22m   Short prompts are over-represented (65% of top-10 results from 52% of the[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 111 [22m   corpus); ≥5-chunk prompts are under-represented (8% of results, 14% of[1C[1B[2m 112 [22m   corpus).[1C[1B[2m 113 [22m4. **"Chunking fixes reranking for free."** Wrong. `MAX_DOC_CHARS` still[1C[1B[2m 114 [22m   truncates at 512 chars against a median chunk of 1 713. Separate fix — 0.2.[1B[39m [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 115 [22m5. **Phase order.** I built chunking before the eval set and cannot now tell[1C[1B[2m 116 [22m   whether it helped. Don't repeat this with the embedding or reranker swaps.[1B[38;2;80;80;80m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌[1B[39m Do you want to create [1mrework_actions.md[22m?[K[1C[1B[38;2;177;185;249m❯[4G[38;2;153;153;153m1. [38;2;177;185;249mYes[1B[39m   [38;2;153;153;153m2. [39mYes, allow all edits during this session [1m(shift+tab)[22m[K[1B  [4G[38;2;153;153;153m3. [39mNo[1B[K[1C[1B[38;2;153;153;153mEsc to cancel ·[18GTab to amend[39m[K[61;1H[57;2H[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h]0;◑ Engineer optimal LLM prompt for task solving[?2026h[H[2G Worth writing down so nobody argues from it later: [1m32k context[22m is irrelevant — your chunks are ~1 700 chars and arctic's 8k already gives 5× more headroom than you use. [1m100+ language support[194G[22mis[197Girrelevant[208G—[210Gthe[214Gvault[220Gis[223GEnglish.[232GBoth[237Gare[241Gheadline[1C[1B features for you're-not-the-customer reasons.[K[1C[1B[K[1C[1B [1mThe cost of being wrong is near zero[22m[K[1C[1B[K[1C[1B Measured against your running server just now:[K[1C[1B[K[1C[1B ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────┐[1C[1B │   [30GOperation[66G│[72GLatency[85G│[1C[1B ├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────┤[1C[1B │ Single query — the[24G[38;2;177;185;249mgate.py[32G[39mpath,[38Gfires[44Gon[47G[1mevery user message[66G[22m│[68G[1m5.4 ms[75G[22m(p90[80G6.1)[85G│[1C[1B ├─────