;200;80m 250 +[38;2;248;248;242mAn all-Qwen stack sounds tidier. Measured, it isn't better.                                                                                                                                                                                             [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 251 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 252 +[38;2;248;248;242m**Same-family coherence is not a retrieval benefit.** Over 20 queries, scoring                                                                                                                                                                          [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 253 +[38;2;248;248;242mthe Qwen retriever's top-30 with each reranker, correlation to the retriever's                                                                                                                                                                          [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 254 +[38;2;248;248;242mown ordering: mxbai **+0.258**, Qwen3-Reranker **+0.321**. The same-family                                                                                                                                                                              [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 255 +[38;2;248;248;242mreranker agrees *more* with the retriever — which makes it slightly more                                                                                                                                                                                [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 256 +[38;2;248;248;242mredundant, since a reranker earns its latency by contributing signal the                                                                                                                                                                                [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 257 +[38;2;248;248;242mretriever lacks. The gap is small and n=20, so read it as "no benefit," not as                                                                                                                                                                          [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 258 +[38;2;248;248;242mevidence against. Either way, the family argument does not survive contact with                                                                                                                                                                         [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 259 +[38;2;248;248;242mmeasurement.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 260 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 261 +[38;2;248;248;242m**Where compatibility genuinely matters is dependencies, and there the                                                                                                                                                                                  [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 262 +[38;2;248;248;242membedder is the whole story.** arctic requires `transformers<5` (its custom                                                                                                                                                                             [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 263 +[38;2;248;248;242mremote code NaNs on 5.4.0). That pin is expensive: `sentence-transformers` 5.5                                                                                                                                                                          [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 264 +[38;2;248;248;242mand `transformers` 4.49 could not even be imported in one process during                                                                                                                                                                                [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 265 +[38;2;248;248;242mtesting (Keras 3 conflict). Both Qwen3 models *and* mxbai run natively on                                                                                                                                                                               [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 266 +[38;2;248;248;242m`transformers` 5.4.0 with no custom code. So dropping arctic removes the pin —                                                                                                                                                                          [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 267 +[38;2;248;248;242mand the reranker choice contributes nothing to that.                                                                                                                                                                                                    [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 268 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 269 +[38;2;248;248;242m**mxbai keeps the calibration you already depend on.** Its 0–1 output clears                                                                                                                                                                            [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 270 +[38;2;248;248;242m`find.py:39`'s `SINGLE_THRESHOLD = 0.3` on 12/15 queries; Qwen3-Reranker emits                                                                                                                                                                          [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 271 +[38;2;248;248;242mraw logits (−14.7 … −1.75) and clears it on 0/15, even after sigmoid (max                                                                                                                                                                               [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 272 +[38;2;248;248;242m0.148). Choosing Qwen on the reranker side means rebuilding the "is anything                                                                                                                                                                            [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 273 +[38;2;248;248;242mgood enough to serve?" decision plus `reranker.py:86` and the `memory_filter`                                                                                                                                                                           [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 274 +[38;2;248;248;242mboosts — real work, bought with no measured gain.                                                                                                                                                                                                       [1B[38;2;80;200;80m 275 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B[49m[2m 276 [22m ---[1B[2m 277 [22m [1B[38;2;80;80;80m╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌[1C[1B[39mDo[5Gy