[68G[1m0.303[81G[22m│[83G0.420[94G│[1B  ├───────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────┼────────────┤[K[1C[1B │ Full corpus[17Gembed[47G│[49G—[66G│[68G24.0[73Gs[81G│[83G36.8[88Gs[94G│[1C[1B └───────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────┴────────────┘[1B[K[1B  Sane again, qualitatively — [3m"financial model for early stage company"[23m now returns [38;2;177;185;249mfinancial-model-reviewer[39m and [38;2;177;185;249mSaaS Business Model Repricing[39m, where before it returned [38;2;177;185;249mImage Gen Art Elements Practice[39m.[K[1B[K[1B  [1mThe two models split by probe type[22m[K[1B[K[1B  Arctic wins [1mlexical[22m matching (verbatim rank-1, 25 vs 19). Qwen3 wins [1msemantic paraphrase[22m by ~1.7× at every k. Your production task — a user's situation matched to a prompt template — is paraphrase, which favours Qwen3. But this is now a genuine[K[1B  trade-off[13Gbetween[21Gtwo[25Gworking[33Gmodels,[41Gnot[45Ga[47Grescue:[1B[K[1B  - [1mArctic fixed[22m: keeps [38;2;177;185;249mVECTOR(768)[39m, already deployed, faster, better lexical. Cost: a pinned [38;2;177;185;249mtransformers<5[39m and a dependency on unmaintained custom remote code that will break again on the next upgrade.[K[1B  - [1mQwen3-0.6B[22m: needs [38;2;177;185;249mVECTOR(1024)[39m, native transformers support with no custom-code liability, clearly better semantics, per-call-site instructions available.[K[1B[K[1B  I'd lean Qwen3 on the paraphrase result and the maintenance argument — but that's a lean, not a finding, and it's exactly the call the eval set should make.[K[1B[K[1B  [1mWhat you must do regardless of which you pick[22m[K[1B[K[1B  [1mEvery embedding in your database is garbage[22m — [38;2;177;185;249mprompts.embedding[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunks.embedding[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mskills.skills.routing_embedding[39m. All were written by the broken server. Re-embed after fixing.[K[1B[K[1B  And add a startup health check to [38;2;177;185;249mserve_embeddings.py[39m: embed two related and two unrelated sentences, assert the related pair wins, refuse to serve otherwise. This has been silently wrong for an unknown length of time.[K[1B[K[1B  Also invalidated: [38;2;177;185;249mgate.py[39m's hand-tuned 0.47 threshold — that razor-thin 0.036 separation gap in your comment was you compensating for a collapsed embedding space, not a model limitation. And my own chunking measurements, since both sides used the[K[1B  broken embedder.[K[1B[K[1B  [38;2;177;185;249mdocs/rework_actions.md[39m is updated; the wrong diagnosis is kept in a collapsed section with a note on why it was wrong.[K[1B[K[1B  I stopped short of restarting your embedding server or rewriting the vectors — the model choice is now genuinely open, and re-embedding should happen once, after you decide. Say the word and it's about a minute either way.[K[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[39m [38;2;153;153;153mWorked for 7m 41s[39m[K[1B[K[1B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mIs it more compatible to have both models be qwen together?[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                 [1B[49m[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  [38;2;255;107;128mUserPromptSubmit hook timed out after 10s — output discarded. Raise the hook's "timeout" to allow more time.[39m[K[1B[K[1B[38;2;255;255;255m●[39m Testable in one respect that matters and isn't obvious: whether a same-family reranker adds [3mindependent[23m signal or just echoes the retriever.[K[1B[K[1B  [38;2;153;153;153mRan [1m1[22m shell command [39m[K[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m●[39m [1mUpdate[22m(]8;id=42cn88;file:///home/bao-tn/Coding/Projects/capillaries/docs/rework_actions.mddocs/rework_actions.md]8;;)[1B[K[1B[38;2;215;119;87m✢[39m [38;2;233;154;122mCrunching…[38;2;215;119;87m [38;2;153;153;153m(1m 48s · ↓[39m [38;2;153;153;153m4.0k tokens)[39m[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Use /theme to change the color theme[39m[K[1C[1B [4G      [236G[38;2;153;153;153m◐ medium · /effort[1B[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[1B[38;2;153;153;153m❯ [4G[39m[K[1B[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[1C[1B[39m [38;2;72;150;140m⏸ plan mode on[18G[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to interrupt · ← for agents[251G]8;id=1cu0pjq;https://claude.ai/code/session_01242VLgVPJTk473Dum6Xf64[38;2;78;186;101m/rc[39m]8;;[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2;56r[39S[r[H[3G[K[13B[38;2;78;186;101m●[1B[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  [39mAdded[12G[1m29[15G[22mlines[1B [3G   [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 243 [22m | 6.3 | Embedding bake-off: arctic-embed-m-v2.0 vs Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B, offline with numpy, no schema change | **[measured]** 2 072 × 1 024 floats ≈ 8 MB; brute-force cosine is exact and sub-millisecond. Full corpus re-embed is **~23 s[1B[39m     [38;2;248;248;242m[2m     [22m ** — swapping is cheap to try and cheap to revert |[5C[1B[2m 244 [22m | 6.4 | Recalibrate `gate.py:49` `SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD` (0.47) after any embedding change | **[measured]** hand-fitted to arctic's cosine distribution in a 0.036-wide gap. Cosine scales are not comparable across models |[5C[1B[2m 245 [22m | 6.5 | Test Qwen3-Embedding's per-call-site instructions | **[unverified]** three sites (`gate.py:219`, `retriever.py:169`, `skills/recall.py:251`) share one prefix but ask three different questions. Mechanism is plausible; evidence is[5C[1B[2m     [22m  zero |[5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 246 +[38;2;248;248;242m| 6.6 | **Recommended pairing: Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B + mxbai-rerank-base-v2** (mixed, not all-Qwen) | **[measured]** see below |                                                                                                             [5C[1B[49m[2m 247 [22m [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 248 +[38;2;248;248;242m### Why the mixed pair, not all-Qwen                                                                                                                                                                                                        [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 249 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 250 +[38;2;248;248;242mAn all-Qwen stack sounds tidier. Measured, it isn't better.                                                                                                                                                                                 [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 251 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 252 +[38;2;248;248;242m**Same-family coherence is not a retrieval benefit.** Over 20 queries, scoring                                                                                                                                                              [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 253 +[38;2;248;248;242mthe Qwen retriever's top-30 with each reranker, correlation to the retriever's                                                                                                                                                              [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 254 +[38;2;248;248;242mown ordering: mxbai **+0.258**, Qwen3-Reranker **+0.321**. The same-family                                                                                                                                                                  [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 255 +[38;2;248;248;242mreranker agrees *more* with the retriever — which makes it slightly more                                                                                                                                                                    [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 256 +[38;2;248;248;242mredundant, since a reranker earns its latency by contributing signal the                                                                                                                                                                    [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 257 +[38;2;248;248;242mretriever lacks. The gap is small and n=20, so read it as "no benefit," not as                                                                                                                                                              [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 258 +[38;2;248;248;242mevidence against. Either way, the family argument does not survive contact with                                                                                                                                                             [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 259 +[38;2;248;248;242mmeasurement.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 260 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 261 +[38;2;248;248;242m**Where compatibility genuinely matters is dependencies, and there the                                                                                                                                                                      [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 262 +[38;2;248;248;242membedder is the whole story.** arctic requires `transformers<5` (its custom                                                                                                                                                                 [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 263 +[38;2;248;248;242mremote code NaNs on 5.4.0). That pin is expensive: `sentence-transformers` 5.5                                                                                                                                                              [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 264 +[38;2;248;248;242mand `transformers` 4.49 could not even be imported in one process during                                                                                                                                                                    [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 265 +[38;2;248;248;242mtesting (Keras 3 conflict). Both Qwen3 models *and* mxbai run natively on                                                                                                                                                                   [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 266 +[38;2;248;248;242m`transformers` 5.4.0 with no custom code. So dropping arctic removes the pin —                                                                                                                                                              [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 267 +[38;2;248;248;242mand the reranker choice contributes nothing to that.                                                                                                                                                                                        [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 268 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 269 +[38;2;248;248;242m**mxbai keeps the calibration you already depend on.** Its 0–1 output clears                                                                                                                                                                [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 270 +[38;2;248;248;242m`find.py:39`'s `SINGLE_THRESHOLD = 0.3` on 12/15 queries; Qwen3-Reranker emits                                                                                                                                                              [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 271 +[38;2;248;248;242mraw logits (−14.7 … −1.75) and clears it on 0/15, even after sigmoid (max                                                                                                                                                                   [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 272 +[38;2;248;248;242m0.148). Choosing Qwen on the reranker side means rebuilding the "is anything                                                                                                                                                                [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 273 +[38;2;248;248;242mgood enough to serve?" decision plus `reranker.py:86` and the `memory_filter`                                                                                                                                                               [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 274 +[38;2;248;248;242mboosts — real work, bought with no measured gain.                                                                                                                                                                                           [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m 275 +[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [5C[1B[49m[2m 276 [22m ---[5C[1B[2m 277 [22m [5C[1B[2m 278 [22m ## Corrections made during the audit[2B[38;2;215;119;87m✢[3G[38;2;233;154;122mCrunching…[38;2;215;119;87m [38;2;153;153;153m(1m 48s · ↓[26G4.0k tokens)[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /theme to change the color theme[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[3G[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/rework_actions.md[26G[39mis[29Gupdated;[38Gthe[42Gwrong[48Gdiagnosis[58Gis[61Gkept[66Gin[69Ga[71Gcollapsed[81Gsection[89Gwith[94Ga[96Gnote[101Gon[104Gwhy[108Git[111Gwas[115Gwrong.[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[54B[38;2;215;119;87m*[3G[38;2;235;159;127mCrunching…[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l]0;◑ Engineer optimal LLM prompt for task solving[?2026h[?25l[H[54B[38;2;215;119;87m·[3GCrunching…[19G[38;2;153;153;153m9[28G4[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2;56r[2S[r[H[3G[K[52B[38;2;255;255;255m●[3G[39m[K[1B[K[1B[38;2;215;119;87m·[3GCrunching… [38;2;153;153;153m(1m 50s · ↓[26G4.4k tokens)[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /theme to change the color theme[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[27C[54B[38;2;153;153;153m5[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l]0;◐ Engineer optimal LLM prompt for task solving[?2026h[?25l[H[54B[38;2;215;119;87m✢[39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[54B[38