                                                                                                              [2C[1B[49m[39m   [38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 271 +[38;2;248;248;242mbackwards — the rework *replaces* that decision layer, so compatibility with it                                                                                                                                                             [2C[1B[49m[39m [6G[38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 272 +[38;2;248;248;242mis not a benefit. See "Decision layer" below. The remaining case for mxbai is                                                                                                                                                               [2C[1B[49m[39m   [38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 273 +[38;2;248;248;242mspeed (536 ms vs 896 ms full-length) and marginally more independent signal.                                                                                                                                                                [2C[1B[49m[39m [5G [38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 274 +[38;2;248;248;242mBoth are real but neither is decisive; this stays open until the eval set                                                                                                                                                                   [2C[1B[49m[39m   [38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 275 +[38;2;248;248;242mexists.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     [2C[1B[49m[39m [5G [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 276 [22m [39m[K[2C[1B   [38;2;248;248;242m[2m 277 [22m ---[39m[K[5C[1B[38;2;248;248;242m[2m 278 [22m [2C[1B[39m   [38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 279 +[38;2;248;248;242m## Decision layer — replace the absolute threshold                         