                                                                                     [5C[1B[38;2;220;90;90m 54 -[38;2;248;248;242m# corpus has since been re-embedded with a different model, so this number                                                                                                                                                                   [5C[1B[38;2;220;90;90m 55 -[38;2;248;248;242m# describes nothing real. It is left in place only so the gate keeps                                                                                                                                                                         [5C[1B[38;2;220;90;90m 56 -[38;2;248;248;242m# functioning; replace it with the z-score/margin decision layer once the eval                                                                                                                                                               [5C[1B[38;2;220;90;90m 57 -[38;2;248;248;242m# set exists, and do not tune it in the meantime — tuning a number against no                                                                                                                                                                [5C[1B[38;2;220;90;90m 58 -[38;2;248;248;242m# ground truth is how the original 0.47 happened.                                                                                                                                                                                            [5C[1B[38;2;220;90;90m 59 -[38;2;248;248;242mSIMILARITY_THRESHOLD = float(os.getenv("CAPILLARIES_SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD", "0.47"))                                                                                                                                                          [5C[1B[38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m 50 +[38;2;117;113;94m# Re-fitted for Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B. The old 0.47 was hand-tuned against[38;2;248;248;242m                                 