y[184Gwords[190Goverlapping[202Gtitles)[210Gthat[215Ghas[219Gnothing[227Gto[230Gdo[233Gwith[238Gwhat[243Gsparse[250Gwould[2C[1Bbe for under this design. It's been measuring[49Gth[52G wrong thing, confiden[75Gly.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BOne[7Gcaveat[14Gfound[20Gwhile[26Gmeasuring:[37G[38;2;177;185;249m_SPEC_TOKEN[49G[39mover-fires[60Gfor[64Grouting.[73GIts[77Gbare-hyphen[89Grule[94Gmatches[102Gordinary[111GEnglish[119G—[121G[38;2;177;185;249mbest-guess[39m,[133G[38;2;177;185;249mpersistent-evergreen[39m,[155G[38;2;177;185;249mbest-of-N[165G[39m—[167Gpushing[175Gthe[179Graw[183Grate[188Gto[191G26%.[196GTightening[207Gto[210Gdouble-dash[222Gflags[228Gand[232Greal[237Gidentifier[248Gshapes[2C[1Bgives the 19% above. The[28Gregex[34Gis[37Gfine[42Gfor[46Ggate[51Gdensity,[60Gwhere[66Gover-firing[78Gis[81Gcheap;[88Grouting[96Gneeds[102Gthe[106Gstricter[115Gversion.[2C[2B[1mWhy this beats weigh[24Ging[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B- [1mOne decision, not two coupled constants.[46G[22mNo[49Gtuning[56G[38;2;177;185;249mw_sparse[65G[39magainst[73G[38;2;177;185;249mRRF_K[79G[39mon[82G20[85Gqueries.[4C[1B[1mThe failure mode[22Gdisapp[29Gars rather than shrinking.[22m All[60Gfou[64G real failures I traced[88G— [38;2;177;185;249mbudget[39m → [3mDepartment Budget Tracker[23m, [38;2;177;185;249mrouting[134G[39m→ [3mLead Routing and Assignment[164G[23m— were ordinary-language[189Gqueries. None c[205Gntains[212Ga[214Gspec[219Gtoken,[226Gso[229Gsparse[236Gnever[242Gruns[247Gand[2C[1Bnever[9Gcollides.[2C[1B- [1mSparse can still surface what dense misses.[22m At 85/15 a spars[66G-only hit ranks below all 50 dense candidates and never[122Gr[124Gaches the user. Under routing, when the[164Gexact channel fires it's a real competitor.[K[2B [3GIncidentally, a hook[24Gfired[30Gon[33Gyour[38Gmessage[46Gjust[51Gnow[55Gand[59Ginjected[68Ga[70G[3m"Route