ng[123Ghelps[129Gonly[134Gthe[138Greranker,[148Gand[152Gthat's[159Ggoverned[168Gby[171G[38;2;177;185;249mDENSE_CANDIDATES[39m,[189Ga[191Gsingle[198Ginteger.[207GWant[212Gto[215Grerank[222G20[225Ginstead[233Gof[236G50?[240GChange[247Gthe[2C[1Binteger, save 114 ms. You don't need sparse to do[53Gthat,[59Gand[63Gyou[67Gdon't[73Gtake[78Gon[81Gany[85Grecall[92Grisk[97Gdoing[103Git.[2C[2B[1mAnd the filter would be empty almost always[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BI[5Gran[9Gyour[14Gexact-match[26Gfilter[33Gover[38Gthe[42G44[45Greal[50Gplexus[57Gqueries[65Gthat[70Gcarry[76Gidentifier-like[92Gtokens:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B┌──────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────┐[2C[1B│       [12G  [15G   [19G          [30G     [46G│[62G│[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────┤[2C[1B│ Median chunks surviving the filter       │ [1m0[22m   [62G│[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────┤[2C[1B│ Max                                      │ 11  [62G│[2C[1B├──────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────┤[2C[1B│ [1mQueries where the filter returns nothing[22m │ [1m41 / 44 = 93%[62G[22m│[2C[1B└──────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────┘[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThe reason is specific[26Gto[29Gyour[34Gcorpus.[42GThe[46Gexact tokens[59Gyou[63Gactually[72Gtype[77G—[79G[38;2;177;185;249mrun_swarm[39m,[90G[38;2;177;185;249mbudget_exhausted[39m,[108G[38;2;177;185;249mmemory_types[39m,[122G[38;2;177;185;249mcapillaries/arteries[143G[39m—[145Gare[149Gcode[154Gidentifiers[166Gfrom[171G[3myour repos[23m.[183GYour[188Gprompt[195Gvault[201Gis[204Gbusiness[213Gand[217Gstrategy[226Gprompts.[235GThose[241Gstrings[249Gdon't[2C[1Bexist in it.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSo filtering-then-ranking would delete the entire[53Gcandidate[63Gset[67G93%[71Gof[74Gthe[78Gtime.[84GFusion[91Gtolerates[101