1mQueries where the filter returns nothing[46G[22m│[48G[1m41 / 44 = 93%[62G[22m│[2C[1B└──────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────┘[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThe[7Greason[14Gis[17Gspecific[26Gto[29Gyour[34Gcorpus.[42GThe[46Gexact[52Gtokens[59Gyou[63Gactually[72Gtype[77G—[79G[38;2;177;185;249mrun_swarm[39m,[90G[38;2;177;185;249mbudget_exhausted[39m,[108G[38;2;177;185;249mmemory_types[39m,[122G[38;2;177;185;249mcapillaries/arteries[143G[39m—[145Gare[149Gcode[154Gidentifiers[166Gfrom[171G[3myour repos[23m.[183GYour[188Gprompt[195Gvault[201Gis[204Gbusiness[213Gand[217Gstrategy[226Gprompts.[235GThose[241Gstrings[249Gdon't[2C[1Bexist in it.[K[2C[2BSo filtering-t[18Gen-ranking would delete the [47Gntir[52G candidate set 93% of the[79Gime.[84GFusion tole[96Gates a useless sparse[118Gresult; [127G filter does not — it's destructive,[164Gand[168Git's[173Gdestructive[185Gexactly[193Gon[196Gthe[200Gqueries[208Git[211Gwas[215Gmeant[221Gto[224Gserve.[2C[2B[1mWhat this means[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThe exact-match use case the diagram imagines needs a corpus that [3mcontains[23m those[84Gtokens.[92GYours[98Gdoesn't.[107GThat's[114Gwhy[118Gevery[124Gsparse[131Gconfiguration[145Ghas[149Glanded[156Gbadly:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B┌[26G┬[81G┐[4C[1B     [11G Design[28G      [35G     [41G       [49G Ou[53Gcome[58G     [64G      [4C[2B50/50[11Gfusion ([21Gday)[28GLexical collisions win — m[55Gasured, 4/4 real failures[4C[2B85/15 fusion    [28GInert; can't surface anything dense missed[2C[1B├[26G┼[81G┤[2C[1B│[5GRoute[11Gby[14Gspec[19Gtokens[26G│[28GFires[34Gon[37G19%,[42Gbut[46Gthe[50Gfilter[57Gis[60Gempty[66G93%[70Gof[73Gthose[81G│[2C[1B├──────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤[K[2C[1B│ [1mFilter-then-rank[22m     │[28G[1mDeletes the candidate set 93% of the time[81G[22m│[2C[1B└─────