g,[167Git's[172Gwhat[177GAND[181Gdoes[186Gto[189Ga[191Gsentence.[201GCombined[210Gwith[215Gthe[219Gearlier[227Gfinding[235Gthat[240Gyour[245Gcode[2C[1Bidentifiers ([38;2;177;185;249mrun_swarm[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mbudget_exhausted[39m) don't appear in a business-prompt vault at[88Gall, exac[98G search has no[113Gadd[118Gssable query population on this corpus.[K[2C[2B[1mAnd this expl[17Gins[21Gmy earlier flip-flopping.[22m Your [38;2;177;185;249m_sparse_search[39m was never exact search — it's OR-matching on the stemmed[125Gnglish confi[138G. The[144G93.7% "spar[156Ge wins naming" number came from loo[193G OR matching on a leaked b[220Gnchma[226Gk, [230Got from exact matching.[2C[1BTwo d[10Gf[13Gent techniques were wearing the[45Gsame n[52Gme in[58Gmy[62Gnalysis, which is why the[88Gstory kep[99Gch[102Gnging. Separating them, as [130Gou asked, made[145Git visible immediately.[2C[2B[1mWhat I'd[12Gtake from this[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BVector[10Galone[16Gis[19Gthe[23Gstrongest[33Gsingle[40Gchannel[48Gon[51Gevery[57Gbenchmark[67Gyou[71Ghave.[77GThe[81Gexact[87Gchannel[95Gis[98Gworth[104Gkeeping[112Gin[115Gthe[119Gcodebase[128Gas[131Ga[133Gstandalone[144Gtool[149G—[151G[38;2;177;185;249mpython3 -m capillaries.search.channels exact "serve.py"[207G[39m—[209Gfor[213Gthe[217Gday[221Gyou[225Ggenuinely[235Gneed[240Gto[243Gfind[248Ga[2C[1Bliteral string, but it should[33Gnot[37Gsit[41Gin[44Gthe[48Gdefault[56Gretrieval[66Gpath,[72Gbecause[80Git[83Gcan't[89Ganswer[96Gthe[100Gqueries[108Gyour[113Gusers[119Gactually[128Gtype.[2C[2BNothing in the existing pipeline changed. [38;2;177;185;249mretriever.py[39m still does its 50/50 RRF; these ar[93G new, separat[107G modules you can run[129Gnd reason about independently. When you want to decide whether anything beyond vector belongs in the d[232Gfault pa[241Gh, the[248Ghonest[2C[1Btest is[11Glabelling real[26Gqueries in[37G[38;2;177;185;249meval/plexus_queries.jsonl[39m — not another rat[81Go.[K[2B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GCrunched for 3m 6s[39m[K[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H     [38;2;248;248;242m[2m  8 [22m                    own notes, [38;2;249;38;114mand[38;2;248;248;242m `notes` appears [38;2;249;38;114min[38;2;248;248;242m no chunk_text, neither[39m[K[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h[?2026h[?25l[H[5C[3B… +101 lines[K[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l(B[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1006h[?2026h[?25l[H[5C[3B[38;2;153;153;153m… +101 lines [39m[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2C[58BW[K[38C[2B               [61;1H[59;4H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[3C[58Bh[61;1H[59;5H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[4C[58Ba[61;1H[59;6H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[5C[58Bt[61;1H[59;7H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[59;8H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[7C[58Be[61;1H[59;9H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[8C[58Bw[61;1H[59;10H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[8C[58B[K[61;1H[59;9H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[7C[58B[K[61;1H[59;8H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[7C[58Bw[61;1H[59;9H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[8C[58Ba[61;1H[59;10H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[9C[58Bs[61;1H[59;11H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[59;12H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[11C[58Bt[61;1H[59;13H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[12C[58Bh[61;1H[59;14H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[13C[58Be[61;1H[59;15H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[59;16H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[15C[58Be[61;1H[59;17H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[16C[58Bx[61;1H[59;18H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[17C[58Ba[61;1H[59;19H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[18C[58Bc[61;1H[59;20H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[19C[58Bt[61;1H[59;21H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[59;22H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[21C[58Bl[61;1H[59;23H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[22C