5;249mRAG_COMPLETION[81G[39m│[2C[1B└────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThree differences that matter[22m[K[2C[2B[1m1[6GIt never fuses vector and lexical — and neith[52Gr should you.[22m These are separate, caller-selected modes. There's no RRF, no weight[135Gratio, no blending in the non-graph[171Gpath. Their[183Gdocs say[192Gproduction w[205Grkl[209Ga[212G should specify a search type explic[250Gly[K[2C[1Band treat [38;2;177;185;249mFEELING_LUCKY[27G[39mas exploratory. That's a mature[59Gsystem[66Gdeclining[76Gto[79Gauto-route,[91Gwhich[97Gis[100Groughly[108Gwhere[114Gthe[118Gmeasurements[131Glanded[138Gus.[142GYour[147Ginstinct[156Gto[159Gbuild[165Gthe[169Gchannels[178Gseparately[189Gmatches[197Ghow[201Gthey[206Gship[211Git.[2C[2B[1m2. Their lexical retriever weights terms; mine deletes them.[22m [38;2;177;185;249mLexicalRetriever.__init__[90G[39mtakes [38;2;177;185;249mtokenizer: Callable, scorer: Callable[39m, and the default [38;2;177;185;249mtokenize_words()[39m is[171G"lowercase, split on [38;2;177;185;249m\w+[39m, d[199Gop stop[207Gwords" — [1mall query tokens are retained[22m,[247Gwith[252Gno[2C[1Bpre-filtering.[18GThe[22Gdocs[27Gdescribe[36Gthe[40Gscoring[48Gas[51GBM25.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BWorth flagging: the code is a[33Gg[35Gneric[41Gpluggable fr[54Gm[56Gwork, so "BM25" is the documented default rather th[108Gn something[120Ghardcoded[130G—[132Gthe[136Gtwo[140Gsources[148Gdon't[154Gquite[160Gagree,[167Gand[171GI'd[175Gverify[182Gagainst[190Gwhichever[200Gscorer[207Gtheir[213Gdefault[221Gconfig[228Ginjects.[2C[2BEither way, the d[22Gign point stands and it's the[52Gfix for my failure cas[75G. BM25[82Ghandle[89G [91Germ[95Grarity [3minside the scoring[23m via IDF. I hand[137Ged it by hard-droppi[158Gg[161Gny[164Gte[167Gm above[175G12% document frequency — which is[209Gwhy [38;2;177;185;249mdecision[39m vanished[231Gfrom [3m"quick sanity check[2C[1Bon a decision I made"[23m a[27Gd the results[41Gwent[46Gto[49Ggarbage.[58GBM25[63Gkeeps[69G[38;2;177;185;249mdecision[78G[39mat[81Glow[85Gweight[92Ginstead[100Gof[103Gdiscarding[114Git.[2C[2BThe catch: Postgres [38;2;177;185;249mts_rank_cd[39m has [1mno[41GIDF at all[22m — it sc[60Gr[64Gby term[72Gfrequency[82Gand[86Gposition[95Gonly.[101GSo[104Gyou[108Gcan't[114Gget[118Gthis[123Gfrom[128Gstock[134Gfull-text[144Gsearch.[152GOptions[160Gare[164GParadeDB's[175G[38;2;177;185;249mpg_search[185G[39mextension,[196Gor[199Gcomputing[209GBM25[214Gin[217GPython[224Gover[229Ga[231Gcandidate[241Gset.[246GThat's[253Ga[2C[1Breal[8Gdecision,[18Gnot[22Ga[24Gconfig[31Gchange.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1m3. [38;2;177;185;249mSUMMARIES[39m is the idea I'd actually steal[47G[22m—[49Gand[53Git[56Gexposes[64Ga[66Ggap.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe thing that undercuts my benchmark[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BCognee indexes [3mprecomputed summaries[23m as a separate retrieval[64Gsurface. You have no equivalent.[97GI[99Gthought[107Gyou[111Gdid[115G—[117Gthe[121G[38;2;177;185;249mnotes[127G[39mfield[133G—[135Gand[139Gbuilt[145Gmy[148G"clean[155Gbenchmark"[166Gon[169Git.[173GLooking[181Gat[184Gwhat's[191Gactually[200Gin[203Gthere:[2C[2B"Scraped[12Gfrom [18Gmail: Your AI credentials d[46Gn't matter. Your artifacts do..."[K[2C[1B"Scraped[12Gfrom[17Gemail:[24GYou're[31GLoading[39G66,000[46GTokens[53Gof[56GPlugins[64GBefore[71GYou[75GEven[80GType..."[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249mnotes[39m is scraped email marketing copy[41G— [44Gr[46Gvenance,[55Gnot[59Gdescription.[72GOnly[77G28.5%[83Gof[86Gprompts[94Ghave[99Git.[2C[2BI described th[18Gt benchmark as "a genuinely held-out human-written description of each prompt." Held-out, ye[111G.[113GA descripti[126G, no.[132G