way,[15Gthe[19Gdesign[26Gpoint[32Gstands[39Gand[43Git's[48Gthe[52Gfix[56Gfor[60Gmy[63Gfailure[71Gcase.[77GBM25[82Ghandles[90Gterm[95Grarity[102G[3minside the scoring[121G[23mvia[125GIDF.[130GI[132Ghandled[140Git[143Gby[146Ghard-dropping[160Gany[164Gterm[169Gabove[175G12%[179Gdocument[188Gfrequency[198G—[200Gwhich[206Gis[209Gwhy[213G[38;2;177;185;249mdecision[222G[39mvanished[231Gfrom[236G[3m"quick sanity check[2C[1Bon a decision I made"[23m and the[33Gr[35Gsults[41Gwent to garb[54Gg[56G. BM25 keeps [38;2;177;185;249mdecision[39m at low weight instead of disc[108Grding it.[K[2C[2BThe catch: Postgr[22G [38;2;177;185;249mts_rank_cd[39m has [1mno IDF at all[52G[22m— it scores by term fr[75Gquency[82Gand po[89Gi[91Gion[95Gonly. So you can't get this from stock fu[137Gl-text search. Optio[158Gs[161Gre[164GPa[167GadeDB's[175G[38;2;177;185;249mpg_search[39m extension, or computing[209GBM25 in Python over a[231Gcandidate set. That's a[K[2C[1Breal decision, not a co[27Gfig change.[K[2C[2B[1m3. [38;2;177;185;249mSUMMARIES[39m is the idea I'd actually[41Gsteal[22m — and it exp[60Gs[64Ga gap.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe thing that undercuts my benchmark[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BCognee[10Gindexes[18G[3mprecomputed summaries[40G[23mas[43Ga[45Gseparate[54Gretrieval[64Gsurface.[73GYou[77Ghave[82Gno[85Gequivalent.[97GI[99Gthought[107Gyou[111Gdid[115G—[117Gthe[121G[38;2;177;185;249mnotes[127G[39mfield[133G—[135Gand[139Gbuilt[145Gmy[148G"clean[155Gbenchmark"[166Gon[169Git.[173GLooking[181Gat[184Gwhat's[191Gactually[200Gin[203Gthere:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B"Scraped[12Gfrom[17Gemail:[24GYour[29GAI[32Gcredentials[44Gdon't[50Gmatter.[58GYour[63Gartifacts[73Gdo..."[2C[1B"Scraped from email: You're Loading 66,000 Tokens of Plugins[64GBefore You Even Type..."[K[2C[2B[38;2;177;185;249mnotes[39m is[12Gscrap[18Gd email marketing copy — pr[46Gvenance, not description. Only 28.5%[83Gof[86Gprompts[94Ghave[99Git.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BI[5Gdescribed[15Gthat[20Gbenchmark[30Gas[33G"a[36Ggenuinely[46Gheld-out[55Ghuman-written[69Gdescription[81Gof[84Geach[89Gprompt."[98GHeld-out,[108Gyes.[113GA[115Gdescription,[128Gno.[132GSo[135G[1m~22–25% recall may say more about the benchmark than about your retrieval[22m,[210Gand[214Gmy[217Grepeated[226Gline[231Gthat[236G"the[241Gsystem[248Gmisses[2C[1Bthree-quarters of its answers" is not[41Gsu[44Gp[46Grted.[K[2C[2BThis also expl[18Gins the underlying mismatch: your prompts are [3minstructions[23m ([38;2;177;185;249m<role>You are a strategist...[39m), [111Go[113Gthe index c[126Gtains[132Gh[134Gw the prompt talks, not what it's for. A user asks "help me build a QBR"; the chunk says "You are an executive[K[2C[1Bcommunic[12Gtion[18Gspecialist." A genera[40Ged one-line[52Gdescription[64Gper[68Gprompt[75Gwould[81Ggive[86Gyou[90Ga[92Gretrieval[102Gsurface[110Gthat[115Gmatches[123Gthe[127Gshape[133Gof[136Greal[141Gqueries[149G—[151Gand[155Ga[157Greal[162Gbenchmark[172Gto[175Greplace[183G[38;2;177;185;249mnotes[39m.[4C[2Bat's one LLM pa[21Gs over 916 prompts, [42Gnd it would plau[59Gibly[64Gmove recall more than every weighting experiment[113Gin this conversation combined.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSources:[12G]8;id=82pciw;https://github.com/topoteretes/cognee[94mcognee repo[24G]8;;[39m·[26G]8;id=1r9gykx;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/topoteretes/cognee/main/cognee/modules/search/types/SearchType.py[94mSearchType enum[42G]8;;[39m·[44G]8;id=1t3ecfk;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/topoteretes/cognee/main/cognee/modules/retrieval/lexical_retriever.py[94mLexicalRetriever[61G]8;;[39m·[63G]8;id=w5flng;https://docs.cognee.ai/core-concepts/main-operations/legacy-operations/search[94mSearch docs]8;;[2C[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GCooked for 2m 48s[2C[