[133GThose[139G20[142Gpoints[149Gand[153G2.3[157Gpoints[164Gof[167Glexical-only[180Ganswers[188Gare[192Gnow[196Greachable.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mBut R@10 hitting the oracle is close to tautological[56G[22mand[60GI[62Gshould[69Gsay[73Gso[76Gplainly:[85Ga[87Gunion[93Gof[96Gtwo[100Gtop-10[107Glists[113Gis[116G10–20[122Gcandidates,[134Gand[138Greturning[148G10[151Gof[154Gthem[159Grecovers[168Gmost[173Gof[176Gthe[180Gunion[186Gwhether[194Gor[197Gnot[201Gthe[205Greranker[214Gis[217Gany[221Ggood.[227GThe[231Gnumber[238Gthat[243Gisn't[249Gfree[2C[1Bis R@1.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mR@1 didn't move.[20G[22m30.0%[26G→[28G30.0%[34Gon[37Ggolden,[45G9.2%[50G→[52G8.4%[57Gon[60Gnotes.[67GThe[71Greranker[80Gis[83Gnot[87Gpromoting[97Gthe[101Gnewly-available[117Glexical[125Ganswers[133Gto[136Gthe[140Gtop[144G—[146Git's[151Gcarrying[160Gthem[165Gat[168Granks[174G5–10.[180GR@5[184Gdoes[189Gimprove[197G(55→65,[205G20.7→24.9),[217Gso[220Git's[225Gordering[234Gthem[239Gsomewhat[2C[1Bsensibly, just not decisively.[34G[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe rerank-only control earns its place.[44G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mvector + rerank[60G[39mis[63Gflat[68Gor[71Gslightly[80G[3mworse[86G[23mthan[91Gvector[98Galone[104Gon[107Gboth[112Gbenchmarks[123G(golden[131GMRR[135G0.393[141G→[143G0.377).[151GSo[154Gthe[158Greranker[167Gadds[172Gnothing[180Gto[183Ga[185Gpure[190Gvector[197Glist[202Ghere[207G—[209Gevery[215Ggain[220Gin[223Gthe[227Gunion[233Grow[237Gcomes[243Gfrom[248Gthe[2C[1Bunion, not the reranking. Without that control I'd have credited[68Gthe cross-encoder.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mRaising [38;2;177;185;249mMAX_DOC_CHARS[39m 512 → 2000 changed almost nothing[59G[22m(golden[67GMRR[71G0.421[77G→[79G0.393,[86Gnotes[92G0.140[98G→[100G0.146).[108GWorth[114Gknowing:[123GI've[128Gbeen[133Gcalling[141Gthat[146Ga[148Gsignificant[160Gbug[164Gbased[170Gon[173Gthe[177Greasoning[187Gthat[192Git[195Gtruncates[205Ga[207Gmedian[214Gchunk.[221GOn[224Gthese[230Gbenchmarks[241Git[244Gisn't[2C[1Bmeasurable. It's still free to fix, but it shouldn't be[59Gsold as[67Ga win[73G[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhat I'd take from this[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BUnion-then-rerank[21Gis[24Ga[26Greal[31Gimprovement[43Gin[46Grecall[53Gand[57Gthe[61Gright[67Garchitecture[80G—[82Git[85Gcaptures[94Gthe[98Gcomplementary[112Ganswers[120Gwithout[128Gany[132Gweight[139Gratio,[146Gand[150Git[153Gdegrades[162Ggracefully[173Gwhen[178Gone[182Gchannel[190Gis[193Gempty.[200GShip[205Gthe[209Gunion.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BDon't[9Gexpect[16Git[19Gto[22Gimprove[30Gwhat[35Glands[41Gat[44Gposition[53G1,[56Gwhich[62Gis[65Gwhat[70G[38;2;177;185;249mfind()[77G[39mactually[86Gserves.[94GThe[98Greranker[107Gis[110Gcurrently[120Ga[122Gpassthrough[134Gon[137Gthis[142Gcorpus,[150Gand[154Gthat's[161Gthe[165Gcomponent[175Gthat[180Gwould[186Ghave[191Gto[194Gget[198Gbetter[205Gfor[209Gthe[213Gextra[219Grecall[226Gto[229Greach[235Gthe[239Guser.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BTwo[7Gcaveats:[16Ggolden[23Gis[26G20[29Gqueries,[38Gso[41G65%[45Gvs[48G55%[52Gis[55Gtwo[59Gqueries.[68GAnd[72Gnotes[78Gremains[86Gscraped[94Gemail[100Gcopy.[106GThe[110G2.3-point[120Ggain[125Gon[128Gnotes[134Gis[137Gthe[141Gmore[146Gtrustworthy[158Gfigure,[166Gand[170Git[173Gis[176Gsmall.[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GBaked for 6m 14s[114G[39m[K[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[K[61;1H[59;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[2C[58BU[38C[2B               [61;1H[59;4H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[3C[58Bs[61;1H[59;5H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[4C[58Be[61;1H[59;6H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[59;7H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[6C[58Bt[61;1H[59;8H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[7C[58Bh[61;1H[59;9H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h