─────────────────┤[2C[1B│ Term combination │ [1mOR[22m — any token admits      │ AND, relaxing to OR       │[2C[1B├──────────────────┼────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ Stemming         │ yes ([38;2;177;185;249menglish[39m)              │ no ([38;2;177;185;249msimple[39m)               │[2C[1B├──────────────────┼────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ Term filtering   │ none — keeps everything    │ drops terms with DF > 15% │[2C[1B├──────────────────┼────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ Indexed fields   │ title(A) + body + taxonomy │ title(A) + body           │[2C[1B└──────────────────┴────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┘[2C[1B[K[2C[1BIt[6Gcasts[12Ga[14Gwide[19Gnet[23Gand[27Glets[32G[38;2;177;185;249mts_rank_cd[43G[39msort[48Git[51Gout.[56GMine[61Gnarrows[69Gthe[73Gquery[79G[3mbefore[86G[23msearching,[97Gand[101Gevery[107Gterm[112GI[114Gdrop[119Gis[122Grecall[129GI[131Gcan't[137Gget[141Gback.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThat's[10Gthe[14Gmistake:[23G[1mprecision at the retrieval stage is destructive, precision at the rerank stage is free.[111G[22mThe[115Greranker[124Greads[130Gthe[134Gactual[141Gtext[146Gand[150Gcan[154Gdiscard[162Ga[164Gbad[168Gcandidate;[179Git[182Gcannot[189Grecover[197Gone[201Gthat[206Gretrieval[216Gnever[222Greturned.[232GMy[235Gearlier[243Gcomplaint[253G—[2C[1Bt[7G OR cause[17G lexical collisions like [38;2;177;185;249mbudget[39m → [3mDepartment Budget Tracker[23m — was correct about precision and[111Girrel[117Gv[120Gt to what[130Ga firs[137G stag[143G is for.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mOne thing worth flagging[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BBoth[8G[38;2;177;185;249m_dense_search[22G[39mand[26G[38;2;177;185;249m_sparse_search[41G[39mread[46G[38;2;177;185;249m[1mprompts[39m, not [38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunks[73G[22m[39m(lines[80