ngs[16Ghappen[23Gduring[30Gthe[34Ggrinding:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWords get reduced to stems.[31G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mmeeting[39G[39m→[41G[38;2;177;185;249mmeet[39m,[47G[38;2;177;185;249manalyzes[56G[39m→[58G[38;2;177;185;249manalyz[39m,[66G[38;2;177;185;249mbusiness[75G[39m→[77G[38;2;177;185;249mbusi[39m.[83GSo[86Ga[88Gsearch[95Gfor[99G[3m"analyze"[109G[23mfinds[115Ga[117Gprompt[124Gthat[129Gsays[134G[3m"analyzes"[145G[23m—[147Gthe[151Gstems[157Gmatch[163Geven[168Gthough[175Gthe[179Gwords[185Gdon't.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mCommon words get dropped.[29G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mthe[39m,[34G[38;2;177;185;249ma[39m,[37G[38;2;177;185;249mis[40G[39mcarry[46Gno[49Gsignal[56Gand[60Garen't[67Gstored.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mEach word records where it came from.[41G[22mThat's[48Gthe[52Gnumbers[60Gand[64Gletters.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mReading [38;2;177;185;249m'meet':11B,43A[2C[1B[22m[39m[K[2C[1BThe[7Gword[12G[38;2;177;185;249mmeet[17G[39mappears[25Gtwice[31Gin[34Gthis[39Grow:[44Gonce[49Gat[52Gposition[61G11[64Gtagged[71G[1mB[22m,[74Gonce[79Gat[82Gposition[91G43[94Gtagged[101G[1mA[22m.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThose[9Gletters[17Gare[21Gthe[25Gimportant[35Gpart:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B┌─────────────────┬────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┐[2C[1B│       tag       │     means      │              source               │[2C[1B├─────────────────┼────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ [1mA[22m               │ most important │ the [1mtitle[22m                         │[2C[1B├─────────────────┼────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ [1mB[22m               │ important      │ the [1msummary[22m                       │[2C[1B├─────────────────┼────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ [3m(no letter)[23m = D │ ordinary       │ the [1mbody text[22m + the taxonomy tags │[2C[1B└─────────────────┴────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────┘[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSo[6G[38;2;177;185;249mmeet[11G[39mis[14Gin[17Gboth[22Gthe[26Gtitle[32Gand[36Gthe[40Gsummary.[49G[38;2;177;185;249m'busi':91[59G[39mhas[63Gno[66Gletter[73G—[75G[38;2;177;185;249mbusiness[84G[39mappears[92Gonly[97Gin[100Gthe[104Gbody.[110G[38;2;177;185;249m'difficult':5B[125G[39m—[127Gthat[132Gword[137Gexists[144G[3monly[149G[23min[152Gthe[156Gsummary;[165Gnowhere[173Gin[176Gthe[180Gtitle[186Gor[189Gbody.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BWhen[8GPostgres[17Granks[23Gresults,[32G[38;2;177;185;249mts_rank_cd[43G[39mscores[50Gan[53GA-match[61Gwell[66Gabove[72Ga[74GD-match.[83GSame[88Gword,[94Gdifferent[104Gworth[110Gdepending[120Gon[123Gwhere[129Git[132Gcame[137Gfrom.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhere summary fits[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BSummary[11Gis[14Gsimply[21G[1mone more text poured into the same card, stamped B[22m:[2C[1B[K[2C[1Btitle[12G→[14Gstamped[22GA[2C[1Bsummary[22GB[29G←[31Gyour[36Gnew[40Gfield[2C[1Bbody + inten[16G/task_type/domain →[36Gstamped D[2C[1B[K[2C[1BTwo[7Gconsequences,[21Gboth[26Gvisible[34Gin[37Gthat[42Gexample:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mIt adds vocabulary the prompt never uses.[45G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mdifficult[39m,[56G[38;2;177;185;249mdebrief[39m,[65G[38;2;177;185;249msubtext[73G[39mare[77Gin[80Gthe[84Gsummary[92Gbecause[100Gyou[104Gwrote[110Gthem[115Gthere.[122GThey[127Garen't[134Gin[137Gthe[141Gprompt's[150Ginstruction[162Gtext.[168GSomeone[176Gsearching[186G[3m"debrief a difficult meeting"[216G[23mnow[220Gmatches[228Gthis[233Gprompt[240G—[242Gbefore[2C[1Bsummaries, they wouldn't have.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mIt outranks body matches.[29G[22mA[31Gword[36Gfound[42Gin[45Gthe[49Gsummary[57Gis[60Gtagged[67GB[69Gand[73Gscores[80Ghigher[87Gthan[92Gthe[96Gsame[101Gword[106Gburied[113Gin[116Gthe[120Gbody[125Gat[128GD.[131GThat's[138Gwhat[143Gmakes[149Gthe[153Gsummary[161Gpunch[167Gabove[173Gits[177G~250[182Gcharacters.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThat's[10Gthe[14Gmechanism[24Gbehind[31Gthe[35Gthing[41GI[43Gmeasured[52Gearlier:[61Gstrip[67Gthe[71Gtitle[77G(weight[85GA)[88Gand[92Glexical[100Grecall[107Ghalves,[115Gbecause[123Gon[126Ga[128Gcorpus[135Gof[138G[3minstructions[23m,[152Gtitle[158Gand[162Gsummary[170Gare[174Gthe[178Gonly[183Gtext[188Gthat[193Gsays[198Gwhat[203Gthe[207Gprompt[214Gis[217G[1mfor[221G[22m—[223Gthe[227Gbody[232Gonly[237Gsays[242Ghow[246Git[2C[1B[1mbehaves[22m.[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BOne[7Gnote:[13Gthis[18Gonly[23Gapplies[31Gto[34Gthe[38G[1mkeyword[46G[22mhalf[51Gof[54Gyour[59Gsearch.[67GThe[71Gvector[78Ghalf[83Gdoesn't[91Guse[95G[38;2;177;185;249msearch_tsv[106G[39mat[109Gall;[114Git[117Guses[122Gthe[126Gembeddings[137Gin[140G[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunks[39m,[155Gand[159Gthose[165Gare[169Gbuilt[175Gfrom[180Gtitle[186G+[188Gchunk[194Gtext[199Gwith[204Gno[207Gsummary[215Gin[218Gthem[223Gyet.[228GSo[231Gyour[236Gsummaries[246Gare[2C[1Bcurren[10Gly[13Ghelping keyword [30Gearch and doing[46Gnothing[54Gf[56Gr sem[62Gntic[67Gsearch — which is probably the bigger opportunity, [119Gince a[126Gsummary describes intent in exactly the way embeddings are good at capturing.[204G[K[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GSautéed for 1m 1s · 1 shell still running[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m※[3G[1mrecap: [22m[3mYou're reworking capillaries' retrieval; the pipeline now runs chunk-level vector plus lexical union with Qwen3 embedding and reranking, and you're generating prompt summaries (510 of 1025 done). Next: finish summary generation, then add [1B[23m[39m [3G[38;2;153;153;153m[3msummaries to th[19G chunk embeddings [38Go[40Gs[42Gmantic search benefits too.[23m[39m[K[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;8;145;178m─────────────