tle[74G[22m│[2C[1B├─────────────────┼────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ [1mB[22m               │ important      │ the [1msummary[22m                       │[2C[1B├─────────────────┼────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┤[2C[1B│ [3m(no letter)[23m = D │ ordinary       │ the [1mbody text[22m + the taxonomy tags │[2C[1B└─────────────────┴────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────┘[2C[1B[K[2C[1BSo [38;2;177;185;249mmeet[11G[39mis[14Gin[17Gboth the ti[29Gle and[36Gthe[40Gsummary. [38;2;177;185;249m'busi':91[59G[39mhas[63Gno[66Gletter[73G— [38;2;177;185;249mbusiness[84G[39mappears[92Gonly[97Gin[100Gthe[104Gbody.[110G[38;2;177;185;249m'difficult':5B[125G[39m—[127Gthat[132Gword[137Gexists[144G[3monly[149G[23min[152Gthe[156Gsummary;[165Gnowhere[173Gin[176Gthe[180Gtitle[186Gor[189Gbody.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BWhen Postgres[17Granks[23Gresults,[32G[38;2;177;185;249mts_rank_cd[39m scores an A-match well above a[74GD-match.[83GSame[88Gword,[94Gdifferent[104Gworth[110Gdepending[120Gon[123Gwhere[129Git[132Gcame[137Gfrom.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhere summary fits[2C[1B[22m[K[2C[1BSummary[11Gis[14Gsimply[21G[1mone more text poured into the same card, stamped B[22m:[2C[1B[K[2C[1Btitle[12G→[14Gstamped[22GA[2C[1Bsummary  → stamped[22GB[29G←[31Gyour[36Gnew[40Gfield[2C[1Bbody[8G+[10Gintent/task_type/domain[34G→[36Gstamped[44GD[2C[1B[K[2C[1BTwo[7Gconsequences,[21Gboth[26Gvisible[34Gin[37Gthat[42Gexample:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mIt adds vocabulary the prompt never uses.[22m [38;2;177;185;249mdifficult[39m,[56G[38;2;177;185;249mdebrief[39m,[65G[38;2;177;185;249msubtext[73G[39mare[77Gin[80Gthe[84Gsummary[92Gbecause[100Gyou[104Gwrote[110Gthem[115Gthere.[122GThey[127Garen't[134Gin[137Gthe[141Gprompt's[150Ginstruction[162Gtext.[168GSomeone[176Gsearching[186G[3m"debrief a difficult meeting"[216G[23mnow[220Gmatches[228Gthis[233Gprompt[240G—[242Gbefore[2C[1Bsummaries, they wouldn't have.[34G[K[2C[2B[1mIt outranks body matches.[22m A word found[42Gin the summary[57Gis[60Gtagged[67GB[69Gand[73Gscores[80Ghigher[87Gthan[92Gthe[96Gsame[101Gword[106Gburied[113Gin[116Gthe[120Gbody[125Gat[128GD.[131GThat's[138Gwhat[143Gmakes[149Gthe[153Gsummary[161Gpunch[167Gabove[173Gits[177G~250[182Gcharacters.[2C[2BThat's the mechanism behind the thing I measured earlier: strip the titl[77G(weight A) [89Gnd[92Gl[94Gxical[100Grecall halves,[115Gbecause on a corpus of [3minstructions[23m, title and[162Gsummary are the only text that says what the prompt is [1mfor[22m — t[226G body only says[242Ghow it[2C[1B[1mbehaves[22m.[K[2C[2BOne note: this only applies[31Gt[33G the [1mkeyword[22m [47Galf of your se[62Grch.[67GThe vect[77G half doesn't use [38;2;177;185;249msearch_tsv[106G[39mat all; it uses the embeddings in [38;2;177;185;249mprompt_chunks[39m, and those are built from title + chunk[194Gtext[199Gwith[204Gno[207Gsummary[215Gin[218Gthem[223Gyet.[228GSo[231Gyour[236Gsummaries[246Gare[2C[1Bcurrently[13Ghelping[21Gkeyword[29Gsearch[36Gand[40Gdoing[46Gnothing[54Gfor[58Gsemantic[67Gsearch[74G—[76Gwhich[82Gis[85Gprobably[94Gthe[98Gbigger[105Gopportunity,[118Gsince[124Ga[126Gsummary[134Gdescribes[144Gintent[151Gin[154Gexactly[162Gthe[166Gway[170Gembeddings[181Gare[185Ggood[190Gat[193Gcapturing.[2C[1B[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GSautéed for 1m 1s · 1 shell still running[2B※[3G[1mrecap: [22m[3mYou're reworking capillaries' retrieval; the pipeline now runs chunk-level vector plus lexical union with Qwen3 embedding and reranking, and you're generating prompt summaries (510 of 1025 done). Next: finish summary generation, then add [23m[39m[K[2C[1B[38;2;153;153;153m[3msummaries to the chunk embeddings so semantic search benefits too.[23m[39m[K[2B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mActually having summaries helps both out because on one hand I can get specific keywords for context, subject, tech stack, etc... to use search_tsv with. On the other hand summaries have inherently more context than just title while compressing from [39m  [1B  [38;2;255;255;255mthe full body for convenience; some titles may sound good or fit semantically but not fit my specific tech stack or hard requirements[39m                                                                                                                       [1B[49m[K[1B[38;2;215;119;87m*[3GSpinn[38;2;235;159;127ming[38;2;215;119;87m… [39m[K[1B[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Get pinged on your phone when long tasks finish · enable push notifications in [38;2;177;185;249m/config[1B[39m[K[1B[38;2;8;145;178m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[48;2;8;145;178m[38;2;0;0;0m fix-embedder-re-embed-corpus [49m[38;2;8;145;178m──[1B[38;2;153;153;153m❯ [39m[K[27C[2B[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← for agents · ↓ to manage[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[52B[38;2;215;119;87m✢[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[52B[38;2;215;119;87m·[7G[38;2;235;159;127mn[10G[38;2;215;119;87mg[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[5C[52B[38;2;235;159;127mn[9G[38;2;215;119;87mn[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[52B[38;2;215;119;87m✢[5G[38;2;235;159;127mi[8G[38;2;215;119;87mi[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[52B[38;2;215;119;87m*[4G[38;2;235;159;127mp[7G[38;2;215;119;87mn[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l[?2026h[?25l[H[52B[38;2;215;119;87m✶[39m[59;1H[57;3H[?25h[?2026l]0;◐ fix-embedder-re-embed-corpus[?2026h[?25l[H