ly[137Gwhat[142Gconcentration[156Gdoes.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BThe[7Gremaining[17G[1m28%[21G[22mis[24Ggenuinely[34Gnew:[39Gyour[44Gframing[52Gwords[58G—[60G[38;2;177;185;249maudience[39m,[70G[38;2;177;185;249mintended for[39m,[84Gthe[88Goutput-shape[101Gnouns[107G—[109Gwhich[115Gdescribe[124Gwhat[129Gthe[133Gprompt[140Gis[143G[3mfor[147G[23mrather[154Gthan[159Gwhat[164Git[167G[3msays[23m.[173GThose[179Gare[183Gthe[187Gones[192Ga[194Guser's[201Gquery[207Gactually[216Gresembles.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mWhat this changes[21G[22m[K[2C[2BIt strengthens the [23Gase for[31Gfold[36Gng the summary into the [1mchunk embedding text[22m rather than keeping a separate summary index. If[130Gsummary is most[146Gy[148Ga concentrated[163Gresta[169Gement of the body, a separate index just[210Gsp[213Gits the same [228Ggnal acro[238Gs two[244Gplaces —[K[2C[1Bwhi[7Gh is[12Gwhat[17Gthe[21Gmeasurement[33Gshowed[40G(summary-only[54G19.7%[60Gvs[63Gchunks[70G28.0%).[78GPutting[86Gthe[90Gsummary[98Ginto[103Geach[108Gchunk's[116Gbreadcrumb[127Ggives[133Gevery[139Gchunk[145Gthe[149Gprompt's[158Gstated[165Gpurpose[173Gand[177Gconstraints,[190Gconcentrated,[204Gwithout[212Ga[214Gsecond[221Gindex[227Gto[230Gkeep[235Gin[238Gsync.[2C[2BAnd it[10Gmeans[16Gthe tech-stack prec[36Gsion you're [49Gfter should show up mostly as[79G[1mrank improvement on queries that name a stack[22m, not as newly-findable prompts. Those[163Gprompts[171Gwere alway[182G findable; [194Gh[196Gy were ranked below top[220Gcally-similar[234Gones[239Gwith[245Ghe wrong[2C[1Bsta[7Gk.[K[2B [3GThat's still untested — nothing in the repo[47Ghas[51Ga[53Gconstraint-bearing[72Gquery.[79GHalf[84Ga[86Gdozen[92Ghand-written[105Gones[110G([38;2;177;185;249m"REST API integration with OAuth"[145G[39magainst[153Ga[155Gpool[160Gof[163Ggeneric[171GAPI[175Gprompts)[184Gwould[190Gsettle[197Git,[