─────┼──────────────────────┤[2C[1B│[5Gbodies[12Gstarting with a markdown heading  [47G [49G│ 40 (4%)[72G│[2C[1B├─────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┤[2C[1B│[5Gbodies[12Gwith[17GObsidian[26Gwikilinks[36G[38;2;177;185;249m[[…]][49G[39m│[51G6[72G│[2C[1B├─────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────┤[2C[1B│[5Gbodies[12Gwith[17GURLs[49G│[51G14[72G│[2C[1B└─────────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1BA[5Gtypical[13Gone[17Gstarts[24Gstraight[33Ginto[38Gthe[42Gprompt:[2C[1B[K[2C[1B<[6Gle>[K[2C[1BYou[7Gare[11Ga[13Gtechnical[23Gstrategy[32Gadvisor[40Gfor[44Gcompanies[54Gbuilding[63Gagentic[71Gproducts.[2C[1BYou[7Gunderstand[18Gthe six-la[29Ger agent protocol stack (MCP for tools,[69GA2A for…[K[2C[2B[1mThe consequences worth knowing[22m[K[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[1mThe title is a filename, not text in the document.[54G[22m[38;2;177;185;249mtitle = md_file.stem[75G[39m—[77Gso[80G[38;2;177;185;249mMeeting Recovery[97G[39mcomes[103Gfrom[108G[38;2;177;185;249mMeeting Recovery.md[39m,[129Gand[133G98%[137Gof[140Gbodies[147Gnever[153Gsay[157Git.[161GThat's[168Gwhy[172Gtitle[178Gcarries[186Gso[189Gmuch[194Gweight[201Gin[204Gretrieval:[215Git's[220Gthe[224Gonly[229Gplace[235Gthe[239Gprompt's[248G[3mname[1B[23m [3Gexists, and it's independent of the body rather[51Gthan[56Ga[58Gduplicate[68Gof[71Git.[2B  [1mEverything structured lives in frontmatter, not the body.[22m [38;2;177;185;249mintent[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mtask_type[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mdomain[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mstatus[39m, [38;2;177;185;249mnotes[39m, [38;2;177;185;249moriginal_link[39m all come from the YAML block via [38;2;177;185;249mparse_frontmatter_to_canonical()[39m. So [38;2;177;185;249mnotes[39m being scraped email copy is a frontmatter field, which is why[K[2C[1Bit[6Gnever[12Gleaks[18Ginto[23G[38;2;177;185;249mprompt_text[35G[39m—[37Gthat's[44Gwhat[49Gmade[54Git[57Ga[59Gclean[65Gbenchmark.[2C[1B[K[2C[1B[38;2;177;185;249m[1mprompt_text[39m is the only raw-truth column.[45G[22mEverything[56Gelse[61Gin[64G[38;2;177;185;249mprompts[72G[39mis[75Geither[82Gfrontmatter[94Gmetadata[103Gor[106Gderived[114G([38;2;177;185;249msearch_tsv[39m,[127G[38;2;177;185;249membedding[39m,[138G[38;2;177;185;249mcontent_hash[39m,[152G[38;2;177;185;249msummary[39m).[162GAnd[166G[38;2;177;185;249mcontent_hash[179G[39mis[182Gcomputed[191Gover[196Gexactly[204Gthis[209Gfield,[216Gwhich[222Gis[225Gwhat[230Gmakes[236Git[239Ga[241Gvalid[247Gchange[1B [3Gsignal.[K[2C[2B[1mTwo known contaminations are inside it[22m,[43Gsince[49Git's[54Ga[56Gverbatim[65Gcopy:[71Gthe[75G169[79Gprompts[87Gthat[92Grepeat[99Gtheir[105Gown[109Gopening[117G(the[122Gchunker[130Gdedupes[138Gthem,[144Gwhich[150Gis[153Gwhy[157Gcorpus[164Gcoverage[173Gis[176G91.6%[182Gnot[186G100%),[193Gand[197Gthe[201G19[204Gmonolith[213Gbodies[220Gup[223Gto[226G41[229Gk[231Gchars.[2C[1B[K[2C[1BOne footnote: [38;2;177;185;249mdspy_optimize.py[34G[39mcan overwrite [38;2;177;185;249mprompt_text[60G[39mwith[65Goptimizer[75Goutput.[83GIt's[88Gnever[94Grun[98G(0[101Goptimization[114Gruns),[121Gbut[125Gthat's[132Gthe[136Gone[140Gpath[145Gwhere[151Gthis[156Gcolumn[163Gwould[169Gstop[174Gbeing[180Ga[182Gfaithful[191Gcopy[196Gof[199Gthe[203Gvault[209Gfile[214G—[216Gand[220G[38;2;177;185;249mchunk.char_start[39m/[38;2;177;185;249mchar_end[246G[39moffsets[2C[1Bare computed against it, so[31Gthey'd silently point into the wrong string.[K[2B[38;2;153;153;153m✻[3GCooked for 1m 3s · 1 shell still running[2B[48;2;55;55;55m[38;2;80;80;80m❯ [38;2;255;255;255mWhat if I substitute prompt_text with summary?[39m                                          